Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在把程序传给你 - 嗯 我看到了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:52.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《虎胆龙威4》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我的账户呢？- 正在转账
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚传输完 你应该已经收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到了 谢谢 - 嘿，你确定这是合法的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在给安全系统做测试 不会有问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音可真性感 我还可以为你做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者对你做些什么？- 我们想要的已经都有了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,呦 猜猜谁刚到手了五万块钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对我电脑做了什么？- 闭嘴 哥们儿 我可没动过它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可不行 永远也不要动我的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:48.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿 美国联邦调查局网络安全部门）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析报告没有显示出有任何损坏 但我们认为这次入侵是有人故意为之
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说我们被黑了？- 不过还没达到拒绝服务的地步
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但肯定是破了我们第一道防线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！把黑名单拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把全国所有可能做这事儿的黑客 都给我抓来问话 现在就办！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那可是有近一千人 现在又是假期的周末 我们已经人手不足了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 防止这类事件是我们的责任 可现在事情居然发生在我们身上 马上去做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 现在已经是晚上了 而且他们散布在全国各地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 找当地执法部门帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然有人觉得可以耍我们 我就要找出是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆！我说过不行！- 露西，你这是在折磨我 知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚出来！- 干什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上滚出来！- 别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人可以碰我的女儿 - 你要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰，住手！- 怎么啦？哦 别这么叫我 我讨厌你这样叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 等一下 你认识这家伙？- 你给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸！住手 我不开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “爸”？你不是说你爸已经死了么 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟这混蛋说我死了？你真这么说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能是夸张了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这家伙是谁？你男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是！- 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 好了吗？对不起 只是…我们处处再说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不接我电话 又不给我回电 - 那是因为我不会跟你说话的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这次又是因为什么呢 露西？- 因为什么？要我列给你听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个理由怎么样：你在监视我 跟踪我 还把我男朋友拉下车…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚说他不是你男朋友 - 他的确不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可你刚刚说我是 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 对不起 我把你的“非”男友拉下了车 行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 露西 宝贝儿 上车吧 咱们走 - 不 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们两个都给我走 行吗？- 就跟我谈一会儿 露西 就…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了 我要去睡觉…一个人睡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼了！你会一个人去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 孩子 等一下 我想跟你谈谈 就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 等我想跟你谈的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我想跟你谈的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你打电话的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西 等一下 露西！露西…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露西·麦克连 - 我不姓麦克连 我姓杰尼洛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 女人哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走 我走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？是我 拉维诺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克连回话 - 你在罗德纳做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我在哪儿？- 我们的车在四年前就都装了追踪器 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:07:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在就正看着你的具体所在地呢 - 长官 这项功能我可好像没有启动哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我们启动的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.47,0:07:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我们只能这么做 听着 联邦调查局的人打电话来要我们协助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做一项排查工作 想要我们去接一个 住在卡姆登的电脑黑客
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他姓法瑞尔 名字叫马修
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好么 卡姆登？你跟我说这些干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚到的 - 伙计 现在是凌晨三点 我已经在回家的路上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便在警校找个便衣得了 他乐不得的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能随便找个便衣！局里要求一定得是个高级探员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子好像是个重要人物 我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去接他就是了 护送他到华盛顿的 联邦办公楼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们那儿今天早上发生了一起 电脑入侵事件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“太好了”！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把刚才那些资料告诉我 再说一遍他名字 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可欠我一人情啊 杰克.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:24.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已连接 法瑞尔·马修）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:30.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你认为有多糟糕？）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:31.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（非常糟糕）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（能指望你吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:35.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不行）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（建议呢？）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:41.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马上消失）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:41.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（离线）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:49.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上传病毒… 完毕）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 别介呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始执行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 纽约警局的 请开下门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你是纽约警局的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我明白了 不用担心 之前也有人 在这块儿迷路的 我很乐意帮忙 你走…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我没有迷路 你是马特…马修·法瑞尔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 他 嗯…现在已经不住这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然了 那你是谁？- 我叫戴茜·杜克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候已经被取笑过无数次了 拜托别再取笑我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以看一下你的证件吗？- 行 当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！“探员”！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来跟真的一样！从玩具城弄来的？还挺不错的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然还有… - 对 那个…看起来确实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,法瑞尔！有人刚破解了杀戮地带9的最新版 想过来看一眼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了！谢谢 你可真会挑时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝点儿什么？咖啡？啤酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到底是因为什么事？- 我不清楚 跟电脑有关
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局的人想找你谈话 咱们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦调查局的人？- 对 联邦调查局的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有四年时间都是在白名单上的 没犯什么事 可是自从上了他妈的那个黑名单之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你玩儿玩具模型？- 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别动那个 - 是类似于特种部队之类的玩具？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是 那个是限量版的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.59,0:11:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个是应该能拆下来的吗？- 不应该 不过它坏了以后会更值钱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以我得谢谢你 - 可以用胶粘一下 它肯定是挺重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其他一些不错的模型 要不要再弄坏几个？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们走吧，好吗？来吧 - 我得关机呀 明白？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是些模型 看来你不常 和女孩子约会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你还真想逃跑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！天，别开枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老天 - 待着别动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走 快点儿！低点儿 低点儿！趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！- 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿的 趴低点儿 懂吗？别起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别离开我！好 我们走！- 好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来邻居们要被吵醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！到里面去！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又回屋里去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？快离开那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是想… - 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回那后面去！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那到底是怎么回事？- 什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你干的吗？- 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操 - 不是我干的 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的！- 跟紧点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 咱们走吧 快 走吧 他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 你能不能慢点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 咱们走 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！跟上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着我 跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 咱们走！跟紧了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车！快 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小子 你会上子弹吗？- 什么？我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会上子弹吗？！- 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把储备箱打开 找备用子弹给枪换上！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去拿车后座上的枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！这身手 难道是马戏团进城了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了吗？- 当然 那是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫卡姆登总部10077 请回应！卡姆登总部10077！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡姆登总部回话 请说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你们的探长说话 紧急事件 请速转达
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是维斯纳探长 - 我是约翰·麦克连 纽约警局探员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告紧急情况 在你辖区内发生一起袭警事件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 情况怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没搞定他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们损失了三个人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤玛斯 新泽西那边出了问题 法瑞尔还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让他跑了？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是派了你们五个人过去的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是又突然出现了另外一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派直升机去接你们 从空中去找他们 的行踪 这你能办得到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 上帝！- 深呼吸就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经在深呼吸了！我 我…就是没法停止发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是激素的作用 你只不过是被吓到了 会过去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我被吓到了！难道你刚才就不害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？这就是你害怕的样子？我可说不清 但你看起来非常的冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前也做过那样的事么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的事？- 杀人之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过 不过已经是很久以前了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那刚刚那些是什么人？他们为什么要杀你？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还他妈把我的公寓给炸了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是去杀你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:20:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么要杀我？- 该你来告诉我 小子！你才是犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止已经有七个黑客死了 都不是在黑名单上名列前茅的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回收他们的硬盘做调查 - 是 长官！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷 马修·法瑞尔 给我找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上办！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多枪是做什么用的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了谨慎起见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当它们是硬件 跟你们这些软件配套的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:21:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 华盛顿！看起来今天又会是独立日假期里一个美丽的周末
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有什么盛大的计划 最好早点出发了 因为交通似乎已经开始拥堵了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！这里就再为正在出行的人们 送出一首经典老歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？怎么…怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？这是什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是Creedence的歌 - Creedence？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Creedence。Creedence Clearwater Revival乐队 经典摇滚乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是谁 是很老没错 但这并不代表就是经典
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以前很烂 到现在还是很烂 - 你不喜欢Creedence？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像是把松果塞到我屁股里一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 你就这样？可真是成熟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计 我已经跟你很合作了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,航行角度060 第二次搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听着 都准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通网的交换机已准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一阶段行动开始
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:05.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿 交通控制中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上一次打开收音机听流行音乐是什么时候？告诉我一个大概的年代就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,70年代？我只是在猜… 那时候麦克尔·杰克逊还是黑人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒退10年 Pearl Jam听过么？那就20年 The Cure乐队 也没听说过？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可是新闻广播 我想听听昨晚你在 卡姆登的那些“朋友”有没有上头条
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下… 你还听新闻哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你现在又对新闻有意见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,意见大了去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.75,0:23:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 所谓的新闻 都是被人为操纵的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天所听到的每句话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是媒体为了一个目的而设计的 那就是让你活在恐惧之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 恐惧？- 绝对的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就会出去花钱买东西 一些你根本用不上或已经有的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样广告商就会在电台上 不断地花钱打广告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要告诉你一件事 你听好了 我可以说上一天的时间 家里还有 几天也看不完的数据可以证明…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.23,0:23:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 我会全面颠覆你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴！- 好吧 好吧 宁愿选择逃避问题也不…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 不 我有事！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在车里就会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！先生 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？不要动 打911就行了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.88,0:24:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.95,0:25:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有的信号灯都变绿了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的信号灯都变绿了 咱们走吧 快
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了？- 拿着你的包 黑客小子 走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们走 - 我还从来没经历过交通事故
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 的确很刺激 这边走 过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你经历过交通事故吗？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.76,0:25:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项60年代的小发明 叫做跑步 你会喜欢的 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.03,0:25:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 芝加哥报告说他们的高架铁路 控制网系统瘫痪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,美铁那里的通讯系统正在发出一级警报
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦航空局刚发出了紧急报告 他们的自动定时系统崩溃了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.50,0:25:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在咱们让他们都出去 呼吸呼吸新鲜空气
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是炭疽病毒警报
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.15,0:26:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！大家都出去！就现在！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰勒 走！快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员注意 请迅速撤出 并到停车场处集合
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.01,0:26:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.09,0:26:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员注意 请迅速撤出 并到停车场处集合
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.33,0:27:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 里面有事需要您处理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.09,0:27:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上你的人 上到四楼去 明白吗？戴好防毒面具
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.01,0:27:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得弄清那儿到底有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我查找所有的系统出错信息 看能不能找到源头
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二阶段行动开始
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.49,0:27:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经开始恐慌了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.33,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为有人在抢他们的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.96,0:28:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些他们辛辛苦苦攒下的每一个铜板
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像列宁说的 他们是“有利用价值的白痴”
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好视频录像
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿的交通系统快瘫痪了 他们还刚刚侵入了金融系统 所有的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.66,0:28:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接交通和财政部门的秘书 还有联邦商业委员会的主席
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家行动起来！肯定有人在哪里留下了蛛丝马迹 去把它找出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.58,0:28:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 副局长伯曼在吗？- 现在不行 你得等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不行？这是马修·法瑞尔 我按照伯曼的要求把他带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.17,0:28:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你搞不清状况的话 那就给我去找个明白人过来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是伯曼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,视频录像准备完毕 可以上传了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 约翰！我很感谢你带法瑞尔过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在情况变了 我们正深陷危机之中 忙于控制局势呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官 你们这儿有没有什么吃的？像点心之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.57,0:29:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要… 我现在真的有点儿低血糖了…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官！- 没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.08,0:29:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管出现了交通系统崩溃和炭疽病毒恐慌 但灾难还远远没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午的股票市场又发生了 疯狂的清仓事件
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦商业委员会认为引发这次恐慌 的原因可能是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,股票交易所内的计算机系统发生了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊！简直糟透了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上并没有看上去的那么糟糕 对付这类事件 我们早有防备
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些都是嫌疑人吗？- 过去是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的七个人在过去的24个小时之内都被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.53,0:29:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也不认识？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:30:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 出现一个系统错误
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.34,0:30:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的美国同胞们… 现在是时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把…恐惧…带入… 你们心中了…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.06,0:30:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要问… - 这是未经批准的播出
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.64,0:30:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你的国家能做些什么… 来避免…这次…危机
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.73,0:30:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就是…毫无办法
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的军事…力量…在这次事件当中…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.19,0:30:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是…无能为力的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好我要说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…伟大…而充满自信的…繁荣崛起… 美国的…发展…与…进步…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.66,0:30:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经走到了…尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.41,0:30:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的那些…关键性…技术… 那些被…这个国家…极为看重的…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.67,0:30:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…通讯…交通…互联网…连接设备…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.88,0:30:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力…能源…重要…设施…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.55,0:31:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的…命运…现在…就在…我们的…掌控之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会疲倦 不会彷徨
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.52,0:31:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道他们是怎么侵入的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.23,0:31:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有…独立日快乐… 致你们每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够吓人的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着多找了几段尼克松的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他们会买账吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对会
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.04,0:31:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 帮我连接电信 交通 任何一个…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.34,0:31:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝！这是场末世入侵行动 - 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是场末世入侵行动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.93,0:31:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们现在还不能知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.39,0:31:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那只不过是个传说 不可能实现的 - 只是个传说？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.72,0:31:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我她在这里还管事啊 顶多是个花瓶罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.35,0:31:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是末世入侵？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个三步的系统入侵方案 可以摧毁整个国家的基本构成
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.94,0:31:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一步：让交通系统瘫痪， 第二步：攻占金融和通讯系统
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:32:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三步：破坏所有设施 比如燃油、水利、电力、核设施…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何电脑控制的东西 这在今天简直就意味着一切
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.95,0:32:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么他们叫它末世入侵 因为一切都得被清除
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.12,0:32:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！听着 听着… 你叫什么来着？法瑞尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.71,0:32:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小声点好吗？这里不准任何人提什么末世入侵的事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你告诉我说你也参与策划了这种事件
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.09,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 哥们儿 我只是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的关心…我们都知道了 也在调查处理之中 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.22,0:32:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的工作到现在为止做得一团糟 - 什么？你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.27,0:32:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我是说我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 他们可不是派个女童子军去杀这小子的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用的是职业杀手 全副武装 把整个公寓都炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.61,0:32:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我不认识这孩子 说老实话这也不关我屁事 当然我没恶意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.49,0:32:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有人想要这孩子的命
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.83,0:32:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很显然这跟现在 这里所发生的事情有某种联系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 国土安全部现在负责询问所有被带来的黑客
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.67,0:32:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找个人陪同你们过去 行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:33:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫利纳 保证这孩子优先被询问 我想知道他到底知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.13,0:33:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是知道我所了解事情的一半 他那小鸟头就该爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.85,0:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特别事务员詹森 我们做这辆车走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事务员詹森？- 没错 这边请
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,“太棒了”！你刚才说的事真的有可能发生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.65,0:33:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吗？好 你看 如果只拿走其中一样东西 系统是可以自动恢复的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一次就把所有的都弄垮 那系统就崩溃了…你看看你周围就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 政府有几十个部门专门处理这事儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.54,0:33:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了上次闹飓风时紧急事务处理部门 可是花了五天时间才把水送到新奥尔良体育馆哪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:34:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要多久才能到国土安全部？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.57,0:34:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗夫林 帮我联系华盛顿警察分队 让他们给我们清出条路来去国土安全部
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.45,0:34:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿交警队 我们是联邦调查局 请求你们清出一条路…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,法瑞尔终于浮出水面了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.33,0:34:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦调查局的人正带他去国土安全部 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.71,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上截断他们的通话 - 隔离通话频率
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.59,0:34:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出汽车的具体位置 再给我把这个约翰·麦克连的档案调出来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰德 我们刚找到法瑞尔 准备追踪他的具体位置
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计们！我不想找麻烦 可咱们刚 经过了一个汉堡店 我已经快饿死了…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.56,0:34:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我连包装纸都可以吃了 - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.81,0:34:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就算是只吃番茄酱包也行 - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.11,0:34:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你十四分钟时间来解释一下 之前为什么要骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.99,0:34:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗你？你…你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙上的那些照片 你认识那些人 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.91,0:34:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不… - 孩子 别骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.62,0:34:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个警察 我知道你在说谎！他们到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.67,0:35:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！好吧 好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.63,0:35:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们和我各自工作 为第三方服务
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下一个口右转到康卡街
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.72,0:35:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个第三方说他们是个软件公司 刚发明出一种新的加密算法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.14,0:35:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看看它到底能不能被破解
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做个就是这个 我…我负责数学部分的安全工作
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.40,0:35:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我正在想… 如果你想实施像末世入侵这样 庞大又变态的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.16,0:35:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就需要成千上万的人来编程序 但要安装运行的话 只要几个黑客就可以搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而到那时 那些做最初工作的人 那些实际上没有做错什么事的人 比如说我…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会落得跟墙上照片上那些人一样的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.58,0:35:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向上帝发誓 麦克连… 我向你发誓 我真的不知道会…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.59,0:35:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把整个世界送上不归路
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.68,0:35:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下一个路口左转到列克星顿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.76,0:35:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那声音可真性感 她干嘛要让我们走这条路？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 510小队 - 哦 上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.77,0:36:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请为两辆联邦调查局的车子清出道路 他们正在前往康卡街
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.98,0:36:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 马上行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是谁？- 你在说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.07,0:36:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是他们 - 你说的“他们”是哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.45,0:36:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你发誓我绝对认识她 不管到哪儿我都认得出这个声音
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.45,0:36:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 什么也别说… - 你先把嘴闭上一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 交警局的 你们那边今天还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.71,0:36:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到那么多举报电话 挺手忙脚乱的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 警官 我们已经全员出动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全员出动 就为了那些光着身子 到处走的疯子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.60,0:36:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说废话了 宝贝儿 叫你老板过来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.35,0:36:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗夫林 我们得离开这条路 左转到十四号大街
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.45,0:36:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克连警官！- 是麦克连探员 混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.54,0:37:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 等哪天我到监狱去看你时 咱们有的是时间来互相认识
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.83,0:37:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 约翰！我已经知道很多关于你的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在布鲁克林的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你房屋抵押贷款的偿还情况 还有你在纽约警局呆了几年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.22,0:37:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 霍利还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真可怜！你们已经离婚了！小露西和杰克是不是很难过？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.31,0:37:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个更可怜！都三十年了 我还以为你的退休金储备 能比现在更丰厚一点儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.73,0:37:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 现在情况变得更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.90,0:37:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那四十万零一千块钱都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.07,0:37:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样吧 让我来补偿你 - 在那个十字路口堵上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.58,0:37:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了法瑞尔 然后开车走人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.75,0:37:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你开到下一个街区末的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一切债务将被全部清零 而你孩子们也将一辈子不用发愁了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.21,0:37:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些条件的确很诱人 尤其是最后那个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.88,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想我只能拒绝了 你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰！你的思想真是太落伍了 跟这个时代格格不入
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.43,0:38:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会一败涂地的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.35,0:38:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 还有一个可能就是我找到你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍你一顿然后砸了你们的派对 你看怎么样 呆子？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.99,0:38:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在那里别离开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.61,0:38:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不回话了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.62,0:38:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！快趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警官在政府大楼拐角遇袭中枪了 重复 有警官中枪了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.40,0:39:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快出来！咱们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.50,0:39:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！抓紧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫总部 我们一辆警车起火了 请求支援！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是总部 我们正派出增援警力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.15,0:39:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己小心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.67,0:39:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧！抓紧…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.56,0:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.86,0:40:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.54,0:40:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目标逃脱了 - 继续跟着他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.13,0:40:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们又来了 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走隧道！左边 左边！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.94,0:40:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝呀 你要干嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.57,0:41:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个隧道的结构图调出来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.78,0:41:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道结构图！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把北边入口打开
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新安排车行方向 开放所有车道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把另一边入口也打开 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.39,0:41:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,起开！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.94,0:41:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.27,0:42:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！别下车！嘿！别…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.40,0:42:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在那儿！站着别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.75,0:42:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.09,0:43:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.76,0:43:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后别再像刚才那样犹豫了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.52,0:43:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 没事 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.19,0:43:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆在这儿 就在这儿等我一会儿 - 什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.49,0:43:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我不能随便找个便衣 约翰！不行”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.91,0:43:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,站到墙那边去 先生！“联邦调查局的人打电话来要求协助”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.24,0:43:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,“你只要到泽西接个孩子 开车送他去华盛顿就行了”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,“这能有什么难的呢 嗯？不可能有那么难的 是吧？”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.84,0:43:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,“不行 一定得是个高级探员”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.55,0:43:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为把路堵住 冲着我扔几辆车 就能拦住我吗？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.89,0:43:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰德 到里面把事情搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要了 他朝我们开过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不是个好主意！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.70,0:44:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别碰我 别碰我 - 好 好 对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.58,0:44:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？哦 上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.62,0:45:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 运气不赖 打得挺准 是吧？- 噢 是 是很幸运 真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.42,0:45:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然用汽车把直升机给打下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.75,0:45:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是没子弹了么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.76,0:45:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么样？- 膝盖破了点皮 还有点儿犯哮喘…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.31,0:45:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 管他什么呢 我没事！- 拉我一把 以后可千万别从车上跳下来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.36,0:45:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰德 回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.74,0:45:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.03,0:45:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那法瑞尔和麦克连呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.62,0:45:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.21,0:45:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.41,0:45:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们继续行动 进入第三阶段！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.63,0:45:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚跟艾默森通过话 他的人已经到乌德隆了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.17,0:45:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！麻衣 准备下载数据
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.43,0:46:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示证件
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.02,0:46:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车停在后面 我们带你进去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好前门！你跟我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.53,0:46:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有五楼以上才解除了炭疽警报 要到下面楼层的话得通过国防部的身份验证
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.58,0:46:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道你们为什么要到下面去 那里除了服务器之外什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.59,0:46:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍 罗德里格斯！我没有听清
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.27,0:46:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已控制前门！- 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.83,0:47:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.78,0:47:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.07,0:47:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿 这简直是荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.11,0:47:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿 这是很坚强 可也很愚蠢 你得去医院 看看你都什么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然不是个医生 但你看起来的确是受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 看上去蛮性感的是吗？- 才不呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.25,0:47:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.63,0:47:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要的不是医生 是警察！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.53,0:48:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.99,0:48:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一让！拜托借个过 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.87,0:48:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！不好意思 不好意思！快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.50,0:48:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约警局的 看到吗？我带着这孩子 来 我们走 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.13,0:48:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳驾 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.01,0:48:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约警局的 纽约警局的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.51,0:48:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.68,0:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.97,0:48:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官！我得跟你谈一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.06,0:48:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医务人员在后面 - 我没事 我是纽约警局的 得跟你谈谈！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.07,0:49:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.53,0:49:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.37,0:49:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.25,0:49:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.35,0:49:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务器已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.47,0:49:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.48,0:49:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始下载
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.15,0:49:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么也没有啊 - 耐心点
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.95,0:49:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不清楚 可它就是没反应 - 再等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.58,0:50:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了？这不就开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.84,0:50:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下到20% 时通知我 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.97,0:50:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.10,0:50:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请让一下！谢谢 - 真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.36,0:50:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孩子？嘿！- 在 在
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.69,0:50:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你那包里有电话吗？- 有
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.32,0:50:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 咱们走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.62,0:50:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个给你 特工姓名…多瓦雷克 就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.81,0:50:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经下到20% 了 - 该行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.06,0:51:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们继续首尾难顾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.00,0:51:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于近期发生的各种事件 执法人员已提高了警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.04,0:51:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让驾车人离开车子 接受检查后方可返回
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.59,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且大家还可以看到 警犬队正在对每一辆车子进行检查
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.68,0:51:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的状况到底是和我们先前听到的 炭疽病毒警报有关
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一起新的恐怖事件 我们现在还不得而知…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 联邦航空局已停止了所有航班 - 很好！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.18,0:51:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们现在可以接通进入所有的网络系统了 通信、电力、供水、核能系统…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.81,0:51:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 不好意思… - 扎克·巴勒 国家安全局的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.11,0:51:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,查克·萨姆 来自国土安全部联络处 我们是白宫派来的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.95,0:51:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么需要吗？我们是来帮忙的 - 帮忙？哇 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.95,0:52:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人需要点空间工作 能给我们腾个地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.79,0:52:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都看到了 我们现在正使用这地方 而你们呢 可以站到那边角落里…负责联络
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.13,0:52:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我需要你们帮忙 会招手叫你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.90,0:52:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 不…不要打电话！- 什么？为什么？你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.86,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能早就入侵了通讯网络 如果你用了它 他们就会找到我们 把电话放一边儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.66,0:52:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者…砸了它也行 嘿 没必要真砸了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.87,0:52:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起！对不起 是警方紧急事件！- 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.71,0:52:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会再打给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.84,0:52:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 就在这儿 到这里来！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.67,0:52:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有信号吗？- 有
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:52:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂！- 是约翰·麦克连 找伯曼警官
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.35,0:53:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 是约翰·麦克连的来电
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.97,0:53:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克连 说吧！- 我们没能到国土安全部
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.31,0:53:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又来追杀那小子 你的人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.69,0:53:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法瑞尔呢？- 他现在和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.65,0:53:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官！- 约翰 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我等着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是“天堂无路”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.20,0:53:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们侵入了所有的一切 整个通讯系统 电话 移动通讯 广播卫星…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.89,0:53:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们屏蔽了所有电视台
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.87,0:53:50.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如果这个只是开始呢？）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.50,0:53:59.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如果你受伤了 独自一人 打911也没人接你电话呢？）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.75,0:54:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以拨回新闻台吗？- 这就是新闻台
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.55,0:54:18.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如果你永远得不到帮助呢？）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.20,0:54:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个台都在播这个 - 已经好几分钟都是这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.44,0:54:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.33,0:54:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.25,0:54:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.00,0:54:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.17,0:54:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯曼！伯曼 你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯曼 那是假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.89,0:55:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.89,0:55:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.81,0:55:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克连？- 伯曼！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.36,0:55:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星信号中断了 给我一部有线电话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只写了一小段代码 却毁了整个世界 这简直就是一场恐怖袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我知道听起来很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.76,0:55:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次听说末世入侵这回事的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.55,0:55:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己还想如果有人真做得到 应该会很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.64,0:55:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要按一下重启键 就可以搞砸整个系统来玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.52,0:55:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！这不是什么系统 是整个国家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.03,0:56:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在说的是人 一整个国家的人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.40,0:56:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤独地坐在家中 吓得半死 明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.03,0:56:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别再回忆你那些过去的时光了 想想怎么帮我抓到这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.37,0:56:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 站在他们的立场上好好想想
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.50,0:56:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 如果是你在做末世入侵行动 你下一步会做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.34,0:56:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！嗯… 末世入侵的关键就在于它大部分都是远程操作的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.22,0:56:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是什么东西都可以网上控制的… 主要的公用设施就不是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.31,0:56:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们由闭路系统运行 所以虽然你可以破坏它的安全系统
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.27,0:56:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要彻底关闭它 就得亲自跑一趟 要到那里才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.52,0:56:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.28,0:56:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那人的掌上电脑给我 - 电话都死机了 不运作了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 电话没事 只是网络中断了 我只要从新设置一下 把它连到老的 卫星通讯系统上就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.58,0:56:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑客们常用那个网络 大概那群家伙也在用它来相互沟通呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.25,0:56:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道这些东西的？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我也不知道 那里有很多 乱七八糟的东西 我不能告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.50,0:57:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这是国家能源分布网
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.34,0:57:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃气跟电力设施分布在三个地区 东部 中部和西部
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.97,0:57:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个地区都有一台主力交换机
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.60,0:57:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.85,0:57:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们现在看到的是？- 东部的交换机
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.73,0:57:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们把那个关掉 整个东海岸就会断电了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.32,0:57:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是那句话 他们一定得亲自到那儿 手动去做
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.86,0:57:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 来 我们走！- 什么？去西维吉尼亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.91,0:57:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的认为自己已经无法忍受再被人追杀了 麦克连 麦克连？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.00,0:57:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会习惯的 - 麦克连！哦 该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 所有的无线网络都瘫痪了 而且他们可能还正在入侵地面网络系统
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.09,0:57:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你用什么方法 一定要给我找到一条可用的线路
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.30,0:57:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说吧 你们有什么发现？- 我们已经排查了整幢大楼 没有任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.68,0:57:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以再查一遍 可我想应该找不到什么… - 不用了 不用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.43,0:57:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个假象 那家伙在耍我们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.85,0:58:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让所有的人回到紧急中心里去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开通道！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.15,0:58:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 上车！- 门锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.69,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你还有一把枪 这样我可以用它来开门
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.91,0:58:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 别那样！你这样车就不能用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真疯狂 你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.29,0:58:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 老兄 我不知道它那么快就出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.76,0:58:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 这还真是够麻烦的 你是怎么把它弄下来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.35,0:58:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？是不是被撞到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.52,0:58:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.40,0:58:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下 别碰那些 好吗？我知道我在做什么 我以前也干过这个
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.82,0:58:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 读到过这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.74,0:58:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路协助中心 我们侦测到您车子的安全气囊已被释放
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.86,0:58:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…拜托你 我们刚撞上了一棵树 而我…我爸现在心脏病发作了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.49,0:59:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他要死了 求你帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.04,0:59:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等 我们会给您联系急救服务的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.92,0:59:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用！他快死了！听着 我可以送他去医院 我能开车 我现在很好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.09,0:59:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就是扭不动钥匙 无法发动车子 你可以帮我发动吗？求求你了 老爸呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.22,0:59:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问您的名字是？- 我叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是…法兰克！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.89,0:59:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸的名字 嗯 是…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.94,0:59:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…佛洛克·瑟金斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.53,0:59:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 帮帮我们就好 我们需要你的帮助 求求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.45,0:59:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车已经上路 马上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.74,0:59:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 等一下 听着 女士… 你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.62,0:59:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 桃丽丝 - 桃丽丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.41,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 桃丽丝！我不知道你还有没有爸爸 但我有
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我希望明年的今天他依然健在
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.17,0:59:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我的父亲他是我的英雄 而现在他就在我的怀中 奄奄一息
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.26,0:59:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一的希望就是马上被送到医院 我们实在是不能等了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.59,0:59:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以求求你快把这该死的车发动起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.39,1:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 桃丽丝！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.27,1:00:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把掌上电脑给我 我要联系“法师”
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.81,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？- “法师” 他是个电脑奇才
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.60,1:00:21.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西维吉尼亚州 东部电力交换中心）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.17,1:00:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐 你无权进入这里 - 联邦调查局 我们怀疑这里有安全漏洞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经许可 你不能在这里降落…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:52.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到西维吉尼亚）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才干得漂亮 小子！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.20,1:00:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.82,1:01:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？没的可抱怨的了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.62,1:01:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.20,1:01:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？你怎么了？- 我不像你 我 我做不了这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.00,1:01:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？像我什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.63,1:01:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像是那种…那种英雄人物 无所不能什么的 我不像你那么勇敢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.47,1:01:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是那种人 - 我可不是什么英雄 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.26,1:01:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在过去的六小时内 已经救了我不下十次了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.97,1:01:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在做自己的工作 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.73,1:01:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道做英雄能得到什么好处吗？什么都没有 只有挨枪子儿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.69,1:01:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人会拍拍你的肩膀 称赞你几句 等等等等 哦 拜托！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.40,1:01:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离婚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.74,1:01:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆都不记得你姓什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.91,1:01:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们不想跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.58,1:01:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己一个人吃饭 没个人陪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 孩子 没人想成为这种人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.96,1:02:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那为什么你还要做这些事情？- 因为现在没有其他人愿意做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.01,1:02:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 如果真有其他人肯做 我绝对会让他们去做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.18,1:02:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在没有 所以只能我们来做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.81,1:02:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.06,1:02:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你为什么会成为现在这样喽
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.24,1:02:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系艾默森 告诉他我们很快就到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.91,1:02:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么？这一层是禁止…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.23,1:03:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.68,1:03:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.28,1:03:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们进去了 - 很好 把它关闭
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.10,1:04:01.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动手动关闭程序）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.76,1:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你说得没错 小子
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.05,1:04:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…这的确…很糟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.01,1:04:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.69,1:04:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要怎样才能关闭整个电网？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.19,1:04:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 呃…中央控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.87,1:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在四楼！四楼！- 走！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.45,1:04:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走右边
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.96,1:04:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.00,1:04:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.47,1:04:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能不能停… - 尽量跟上来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.63,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟着你！我只是想休息一下喘口气
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有健身房这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 咱们走 走！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.05,1:05:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报显示这些恐怖分子是具有移动性的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.85,1:05:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我们才无法利用三角定位找到他们 这是他们唯一的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.81,1:05:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到他们要运行大量硬件设备
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.31,1:05:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标应该是在大型运输车辆当中 极有可能是货柜车
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.06,1:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 告诉国土安全局的那帮人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们需要他们所有的人力 卫星及可运行的网络 现在就要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.88,1:06:09.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电力关闭程序 95%的发电机组已经可以关闭 是否继续？）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏时间结束了 甜心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.93,1:06:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.18,1:06:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手从枪上拿开 把手举起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.43,1:06:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.65,1:06:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去呀 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 小子 看你的了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.98,1:06:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.24,1:06:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.91,1:06:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:06:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经受够了这他妈的功夫！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.01,1:07:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也碰过别的母狗 但你可能是最凶的一只…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.56,1:07:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这拳怎么样 呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.65,1:07:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续做你的 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.98,1:07:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还需要多久？- 嗯…用不了多久
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.20,1:07:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.92,1:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了么？- 我 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.59,1:07:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了没有？- 不 还没
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.59,1:07:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 这可不像收取信件那么简单
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经进入了虚拟模式 我现在 要断开他们接入的系统功能接口 重启主机
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？！- 就是说我需要30秒钟时间 行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.93,1:07:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这事可不简单 尤其是在…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.07,1:08:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你刚才所做的事全部撤销 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.95,1:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.91,1:08:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是右撇子 右撇子 我得用我的右手 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.04,1:08:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是右撇子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.74,1:08:24.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（员工专用停车场）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩最后一步了…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.87,1:08:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你在做什么吗？你知道这样做会给国家造成什么后果吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.96,1:09:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 快点儿干！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好 很高兴我们有相同的认知
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.14,1:09:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都知道？很高兴你能知道这些
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.87,1:09:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.84,1:09:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.79,1:10:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们能不能好好谈谈…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.46,1:11:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？还不是太紧吧 呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.51,1:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.43,1:11:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吃我一拳！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.26,1:11:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.68,1:11:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.10,1:11:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连 快出来！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.85,1:12:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伙计 快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.38,1:12:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.97,1:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你把他们做的都停下来了 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.05,1:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 是 不过你知道 当有一把枪指着你时做事会更难专心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我就知道你是这种反应
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.81,1:12:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就不能把它关掉？或者锁住？- 我也不确定
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.57,1:12:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我也许能拖延些时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.20,1:12:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部和中部的电力转换中心都是我们的了 现在就等麻衣那边了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.58,1:13:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不太对劲 所有的安全系统又重新启动了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.46,1:13:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有人可能想买点儿便宜的伟哥哦 那就给你来点儿广告吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.59,1:13:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你码子已经死了 干嘛不上性感单身族网站 找个美眉聊天呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.13,1:13:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个电子炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.56,1:13:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.19,1:13:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.63,1:13:31.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在跟踪远程通讯）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻衣 回话 发生了什么事？- 麻衣？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 对 就是那个爱踢人的亚洲小妞儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看她得很长时间都无法再跟任何人说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.08,1:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次看到她时 她还在电梯升降道的底部 被一台休旅车撞得稀巴烂呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.38,1:13:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？说不出话来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 蠢蛋 你的末世入侵行动已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.89,1:14:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的那个小杂耍团收拾收拾滚吧 否则我会去找你 然后好好修理你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.43,1:14:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道我是谁 我的能力有多大
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.65,1:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我把这里的事结束以后… 我保证用不了多久…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.40,1:14:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会全心全力地对付你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把这事儿弄成私人恩怨？好 奉陪到底
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.34,1:14:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整所有的天然气输送方向 统统给我转到东部中心
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.39,1:14:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能用这个联络到伯曼么？- 当然可以 联络任何人都没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.11,1:14:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快联系他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.36,1:14:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就现在？- 对 就现在
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.86,1:15:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.78,1:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是汤玛斯·盖布尔 - 妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.45,1:15:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识这家伙？- 我和他共事过
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.79,1:15:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来是国防部内部安全系统的主程序员
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.42,1:15:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,9/11事件后 他告知众参谋长 国防安全系统有弱点 极易被攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.55,1:15:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要整个系统做彻底检修 但他们不听 盖布尔可并不是那种好脾气 待人友善的人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也这么看？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他企图公开这一切时 他们毁了他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.76,1:15:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉了他的名誉 冻结了他的财产… 那之后他就消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.06,1:15:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个蛮严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.56,1:15:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下…什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.81,1:15:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们需要马上离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.94,1:15:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们正把天然气导向这里 - 天然气？什么天然气？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.57,1:15:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.32,1:15:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 所有的天然气 看到那些闪烁的箭头了吗？情况非常不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.54,1:15:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有那些都朝这里来了？- 对 我想我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我们必需要走了 你快去找盖布尔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.67,1:15:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连？麦克连？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.17,1:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走了 快点搞定！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上走！快弄完 快点！走吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.66,1:16:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！进去！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.17,1:17:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.67,1:17:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 我们得出去 - 有什么意义呢？这到底有什么意义？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.88,1:17:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别闹了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.26,1:17:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些跟你帮他们写的代码有关 快 好好想想 帮助咱们取胜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.93,1:17:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,取胜？我们什么时候开始取胜了 呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.77,1:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看周围 你疯了吗？我们看起来像是要取胜的样子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.19,1:17:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚被修理得很惨哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我还瞒着你什么吗？以为我还有什么没告诉你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.95,1:17:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道他们想要什么 我会告诉你的！我会很乐意地告诉你的！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.62,1:17:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.66,1:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,“法师”…“法师”…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.74,1:18:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太棒了！妈的 手机也没用了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.87,1:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们把卫星都从天上打下来了吗？- 不 是电池没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.58,1:18:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对了 我们应该去见他 - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.46,1:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,“法师”啊 我们可以开车去他家 就在巴尔的摩
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.34,1:18:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在才不要去什么“法师”家 - 嘿！你想要我帮你 我这就是在帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.22,1:18:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？相信我 我们必须去找法师 这是我们唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.93,1:19:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢飞行吗？- 嗯 你说什么？就像是和飞行员一起吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.53,1:19:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它插进那“圆型的”东西里就行了 - 什么“棕色的”东西？（二者发音相似）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.37,1:19:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喏 把这个戴上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.24,1:19:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它插进去就好了 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.91,1:19:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 还好 只是有点怕飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.00,1:19:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以前也对飞行怕得要死 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.54,1:19:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我还上了些课 诸如“直面恐惧”之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.09,1:19:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？有用吗？- 没什么用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.93,1:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它应该发出这种声音吗？- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许我们应该开车去 就像在马路上兜风那样… - 放松点 起飞可是最难的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.11,1:19:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我听说…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.73,1:19:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说实话 我错过了几节飞行课 - 哈哈哈！真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.32,1:19:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是有执照的吧？我是说 你还是可以真正开飞机什么的吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.82,1:20:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 上帝！- 嘿嘿 出发！我们起飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.67,1:20:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 还蛮好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.84,1:20:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你看 这整个地区都是漆黑一片
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能找到“法师”的家？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.43,1:20:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 应该就是依然还亮着灯的那家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.57,1:20:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,断电正在不断蔓延 大约一半的东海岸地区已经停电了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.95,1:20:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把所有东西都接到应急发电机上
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.53,1:20:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底是怎么突破我们防线的？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.75,1:20:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 就在那下面 在那下面 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在那下面？- 往左 下去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.55,1:20:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我们就在那儿降落吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.34,1:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 抓紧了 - 好 好 哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.47,1:21:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心栅栏！栅栏！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.77,1:21:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 栅栏！看着点儿栅栏！- 我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.10,1:21:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.73,1:21:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.53,1:21:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪！- 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.54,1:21:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 没错 没错 “起飞可是最困难的”
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.08,1:21:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.21,1:21:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 关于法师 有件事你必须要了解 他很恨警察 真的很恨
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.22,1:21:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以让我来跟他说话就好了 明白？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.31,1:21:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.31,1:21:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 卡鲁迪斯太太
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.69,1:21:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 弗来迪在家吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.32,1:22:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是马特·法瑞尔 这位是 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.45,1:22:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是他朋友…太空夏令营的朋友 我们跟弗来迪一起去过太空夏令营
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.75,1:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗来迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.79,1:22:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗来迪？- 有人来找你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.93,1:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗来德利克！没听到我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.18,1:22:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个巴尔地摩都听到了 妈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.31,1:22:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友来了 - 朋友？什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.14,1:22:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！我还得跟你说几次啊？不许带任何人到这里来！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.19,1:22:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快认不出来了 这就是年轻又留了胡子的汉·索罗吗？发生什么事了？你瘦了好多！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.14,1:22:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我倒长了30磅 那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.75,1:22:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 那是… - 算了 无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.48,1:22:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你又来这里做什么？就是因为你 我得用五台发电机才能保持在线
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.23,1:22:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上你现在又被人追杀 所以你的来访对我来说也不是什么好事
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.70,1:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别碰那个好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.70,1:23:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,民用波段电台？对你们来说也太小儿科了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.62,1:23:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小儿科？哥们儿 那可是 世界末日来临时的保障 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.33,1:23:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是最后一块芯片都挂掉了 我还能继续和外界保持联络
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.92,1:23:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管对方是具僵尸还是别的什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.21,1:23:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你带你爸爸来这里干嘛？- 他很前卫哦 对电玩文化很感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.55,1:23:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,海报不错
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.39,1:23:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么？你很喜欢费特？- 不 我还是比较喜欢星际大战
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.90,1:23:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喜欢星际大战…他到底是谁？- 他在开玩笑…他是我的…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.69,1:23:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你个笨小子！我不是他爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.19,1:23:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是个警察 怎么样吧？- 噢 警察 真不好意思 谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.32,1:23:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛带个警察来我的控制中心？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.74,1:23:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 控制中心？这不过是个地下室！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.99,1:23:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是控制中心！- 别说了 麦克连 我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我们汤玛斯·盖布尔的事就行了 我们就是为这事儿来的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.46,1:23:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤玛斯·盖布尔？哦 很好 我不知道 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.63,1:23:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！我要你们现在给我出去！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.05,1:23:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 冷静点 冷静点！胖小子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.38,1:23:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才冷静点！这是我家！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.89,1:24:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我我想知道的 不然我就在你家揍死你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.03,1:24:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年前国防部雇用了汤玛斯·盖布尔 做他们的电脑顾问
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.49,1:24:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上任的第一天 他就跟上司说
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.70,1:24:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个国家的安全系统 充斥着漏洞 门户洞开
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.37,1:24:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说“我们会考虑你的建议的” 但他是个很有责任感的人 并没有就此作罢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.67,1:24:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就直接闯进参谋长联席会议
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.67,1:24:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅凭着一台笔记本电脑 就黑掉了 北美空军防卫司令部 关闭了整个国防网络系统
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.68,1:24:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他们就拿枪对着他的脑袋 叫他停止这种攻击行为
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.10,1:24:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤玛斯·盖布尔就是为了证明自己的观点 能用一台笔记本电脑关闭整个北美空防司令部的人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.35,1:24:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为我还会怕你吗？- 告诉我们怎么找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.19,1:24:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道？他是个幽灵 已经从人间消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.44,1:24:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这条路也走不通 咱们走吧 - 等等 麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.74,1:24:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,“法师” 你听着 几个星期前 我写了…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.24,1:25:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你写了个新加密算法的代码 现在就可能正被汤玛斯·盖布尔用着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.95,1:25:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们知道这点 好吧 但你知道他用那个代码做什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.37,1:25:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我一直在尝试着找出答案 在这儿 你们看
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.25,1:25:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个国家里唯一一个 正在使用那块模板的安全系统
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.50,1:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是社会安全局
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.05,1:25:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还并不是在总局里运行 看 而是在伍德隆的这栋大楼里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.51,1:25:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇噢 这到底是怎么？上帝！- 我知道 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.73,1:25:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对什么 你们到底在说些什么？- 用电量高得惊人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.52,1:25:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非常高非常热 都快着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.94,1:25:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿怎么会有这些冷却塔？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.32,1:25:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.78,1:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是冷却塔？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.36,1:25:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我一直就是和这种菜鸟合作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.87,1:25:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大型主机群运行会产生很多热量 所以需要冷却系统
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.54,1:25:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么是在那儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.04,1:25:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 虽然我不知道那里面是什么 但绝对不是社会安全保障号码
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.38,1:26:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里出现了警报！有人侵入了伍德隆
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.39,1:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正挂载在主机上
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.31,1:26:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,“弗来德利克·卡鲁迪斯”
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.56,1:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们来看看他 - 这头肥猪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.73,1:26:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.19,1:26:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的女儿现在在哪儿？- 我们追踪到了她的手机讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.70,1:26:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.54,1:26:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 让我们来仔细看看你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.30,1:26:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗来迪？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.26,1:26:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你钻到我网络里来搞什么鬼 呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.23,1:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.10,1:26:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我已经杀了你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.11,1:26:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我时常听到
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.24,1:27:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能不能追踪到他在哪里？- 可以 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.86,1:27:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,探长 用手遮住摄影机可并不能关掉麦克风哈
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.20,1:27:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道在电脑方面我不如你们聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.46,1:27:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 嘿 我还活着 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你那边的坏人一定是快死光了吧？呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.22,1:27:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖布尔？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.81,1:27:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句实话 你可以告诉我 你是怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.27,1:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是有一种服务？什么800号码之类的？比如说1-800-找帮凶？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.15,1:27:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我敢打赌你一定还在线上
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.61,1:27:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊着“能不能再帮我找一个 死亚洲婊子过来？”是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.24,1:27:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过说真的 估且不论她的腿功 那个精瘦的女忍者还真是够辣的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.33,1:28:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找这么一个 一定很不容易吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.71,1:28:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好像很得意啊？- 我也有值得骄傲的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.46,1:28:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.14,1:28:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这也是其中之一吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.52,1:28:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 这是紧急服务中心
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.48,1:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢天谢地 - 她听得到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.40,1:28:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫露西·杰尼洛 我被困在这里好几个小时了 手机也不通
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.19,1:28:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她听得到吗？露西 快挂掉电话！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.11,1:28:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静 小姐 我们知道你的确切位置
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.37,1:28:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.33,1:28:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 露西 快挂掉电话！- 拜托 约翰 我正在讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.75,1:28:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚任务很多 我们有点人手不足 这点我想你也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.84,1:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我向你保证我们会救你出去的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.46,1:28:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 即使是我必须亲自前去也没问题 - 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.88,1:28:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这期间 你需要我们帮你联系什么人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.56,1:28:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.06,1:28:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.39,1:29:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫做约翰·麦克连 是纽约市警察
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.77,1:29:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到他的 再坚持一下 小姐 我们马上会去救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.57,1:29:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.62,1:29:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢 你女儿真不赖 都等不及要见到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.91,1:29:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么啦？说不出话来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.58,1:29:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.88,1:29:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲个笑话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.51,1:29:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点儿好笑的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.07,1:29:33.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乌德隆）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.60,1:29:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.35,1:29:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦克连 等等 你要去哪里？要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.02,1:29:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我要去干什么？我要去杀了这个人 救我女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.32,1:29:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但她可能会在任何地方… - 嘿 听好 接下来会很混乱的 你就留在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.49,1:29:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我… - 嘿 我这是在帮你的忙
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.16,1:29:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己都没把握 懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.66,1:30:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就由我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.75,1:30:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我忙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你也没把握 所以我还是该帮你一把
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.72,1:30:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.71,1:30:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我们是泽西分部的FBI
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.08,1:30:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看一下你的证件吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.17,1:30:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.30,1:31:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是警察 所以才会有这种习惯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.35,1:31:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来你爸爸倒是个聪明人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.27,1:31:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你能联络到伯曼吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.69,1:31:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 可以
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.41,1:31:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不通
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.50,1:31:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖布尔一定是关闭了所有卫星通讯 妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.38,1:31:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于露西的事 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.43,1:31:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有所有这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.76,1:31:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错 把你牵涉其中 这些其实都不关你的事的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.68,1:31:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好抱歉的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.48,1:31:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 你个杂种！- 这贱货真难缠
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.49,1:32:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在没事了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.45,1:32:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实点 不然我会伤到你的！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.58,1:32:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那我们两个出去单挑 看是谁能伤到谁
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.55,1:32:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有其父 必有其女
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她的手绑起来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.81,1:32:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷 盖布尔想见你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.23,1:32:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是时候了吗？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.06,1:32:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.40,1:32:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.99,1:32:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 求求你 不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.95,1:33:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人从外围的通风口侵入
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.21,1:33:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.17,1:33:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太久 我们马上要收拾东西走人了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.06,1:33:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦克连 我们是不是该有个计划什么的？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.86,1:33:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到露西 杀死其它所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.98,1:34:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说比这更像是个计划的 比如说 怎么实现你刚说的目标
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.07,1:34:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.12,1:34:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 根据设计图 冷却塔是在最底层
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.84,1:34:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好没上锁
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.59,1:34:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 看来我们的确是到了关键地带了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.02,1:34:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.36,1:34:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来控制冷却系统的主机应该是在…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.70,1:34:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能侵入到这里…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.41,1:34:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,触动警铃 这样可能就会引起伯曼的注意
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.71,1:35:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人触动了警铃
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.59,1:35:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你了 警探 我也能听得到 快想法儿关掉它
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.89,1:35:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.97,1:35:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了问题 乌德隆的警铃响了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.77,1:35:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.77,1:35:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那乌德隆又是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.11,1:35:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国家安全局 它是设在巴尔地摩城外的一个安全设施点
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.28,1:35:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们9/11之后建的一项安全设施 为的是在危机时备份所有的金融资料
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.12,1:35:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦网络遭到入侵 所有的金融资料就会 自动被下载到那边的主机做为备份
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.21,1:35:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行、华尔街、企业档案、政府基金… 所有这些
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.38,1:35:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上就是整个美国所积累的财富总和
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.30,1:35:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都在一个地点？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.85,1:35:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖布尔又能用它来做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.60,1:36:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他能进得去 就可以把资料都转到移动硬盘上
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.64,1:36:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就可以在任何地方操控这些帐户 把几十亿元收归囊中
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.61,1:36:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们完全无法追踪到
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.28,1:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 以我对他的了解 他可能会删除所有资料 让我们一文不名 回到石器时代
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.28,1:36:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么你们没告诉过我这件事？- 说实话 以你的职位级别还不够格
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.75,1:36:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不够格？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.17,1:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连我都不知道 那盖布尔到底是怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.80,1:36:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是设计者
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.47,1:36:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他设计的程序
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.35,1:36:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道昨晚黑掉你的系统后 下载就会自动开始
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.73,1:36:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.40,1:36:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这两个天才 别在这儿挡我的道了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.61,1:36:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看能不能找到这地方的地面分布图
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.91,1:36:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.95,1:37:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！离开电脑！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.58,1:37:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.29,1:37:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.29,1:37:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我也一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.99,1:37:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.16,1:37:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.29,1:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.08,1:37:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.29,1:37:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.81,1:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾默森
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.94,1:38:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个冷却塔好像出了点问题
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.44,1:38:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七号塔 - 七号塔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.90,1:38:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.32,1:38:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.45,1:38:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.58,1:38:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的队伍准备待命 我们得去乌德隆
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.37,1:38:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,路全都堵死了 现在华盛顿地区被挤得水泄不通
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.25,1:38:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去弄几架直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.17,1:38:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机都被五角大楼调去做搜救工作了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.21,1:38:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫利纳 马上去给我弄几架他妈的直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.72,1:38:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 五角大楼正在让战斗机 在华盛顿上空巡查
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.89,1:38:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们派一架到乌德隆 在我们到达前要密切监视一切动向
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.93,1:38:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们出发
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.15,1:38:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.32,1:39:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁索 回话
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.70,1:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想鲁索现在正往黄泉路上 去见你女友呢 混帐
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.92,1:39:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 他好像还有话说
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.63,1:39:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是麦克连！他在3楼！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.13,1:39:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听到了？没错
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.47,1:39:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在3楼 不过我马上要去找你了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.61,1:39:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 我会找医生来的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.28,1:39:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了这家伙 我把麻衣的那份分给你
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.53,1:39:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.20,1:40:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的加密程序
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.13,1:40:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.13,1:40:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托拜托 上帝呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.29,1:41:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天！他们是想要钱
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.32,1:41:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要过来找我吗 约翰？那就是你的计划？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.32,1:41:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那就是我的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.62,1:41:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么就知道我现在不会 朝你女儿脑袋开一枪呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.08,1:41:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你怕我 - 是吗？你以为我怕你？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.08,1:42:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然她早就已经死了 你需要一个谈判筹码
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.34,1:42:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下！举起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.18,1:42:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了我 就永远也打不开它了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.72,1:42:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小子都做了些什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.56,1:42:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 走开！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.03,1:42:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 我认为我们一开始 就对彼此产生了误会
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.20,1:42:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为如此 你认为我是个坏人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.87,1:42:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是大错特错的 我才是好人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.75,1:42:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过他们如果不做好准备 这种事情是会发生的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.33,1:42:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有感谢我吗？没有！我反倒被他们毁了 可他们就是不听
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.00,1:42:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你现在引起他们的注意力了 不是吗？- 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.92,1:42:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是在帮这个国家的忙 - 哈 帮它弄得四分五裂是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.68,1:42:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我破坏总比被外人破坏要好 比被那些相信世界末日的宗教狂热份子破坏要好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.89,1:43:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人想看到那种情况发生的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.64,1:43:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有我破坏的东西都可以被修复 只要国家愿意出钱
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.98,1:43:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 屁话！永远都只是为了钱
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.36,1:43:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？我这么辛苦的工作不该得到酬劳吗？我可是拼了命地在工作啊 约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.66,1:43:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就坐好了等着吧 混账东西 我有张支票要给你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.42,1:43:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法和他说话 你跟他说吧 看能不能让他听进去
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.29,1:43:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.34,1:43:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.47,1:43:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们只剩下五个人了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.31,1:43:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 露西 我来了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.11,1:43:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能不能给我杀了这狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.24,1:43:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.95,1:44:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实也没有什么麻烦 我只是下错了楼层
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.58,1:44:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,全乱套了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.59,1:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我真佩服你 要破解整个国家的所有财政资料
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.88,1:44:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,得需要几个星期的时间 除非你能先消除网络拥挤状况
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.22,1:44:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次末世入侵就是为了这个吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.47,1:44:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是太高明了！- 对 是很高明 请你安静点
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.77,1:44:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋 - 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.90,1:44:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,马特·法瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.27,1:44:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西·麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.69,1:44:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你姓杰尼洛 露西·杰尼洛
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.24,1:44:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不是
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.12,1:44:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能破解密码吗？- 也许吧 如果我有足够时间的话
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.16,1:44:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真令人鼓舞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.08,1:44:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上他们走
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.46,1:44:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱们走 - 咱们走
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖布尔 国防部刚派了架F-35 朝我们这边过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.01,1:44:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视着它
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.97,1:45:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始破解攻击指令密码
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.53,1:45:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许该开始想想 墓碑上要写点儿什么了 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.83,1:45:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 他妈的跟老鼠一样！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.21,1:45:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.71,1:45:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动啊 蜘蛛小子！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.18,1:45:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.04,1:46:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.05,1:46:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.68,1:46:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你不应该激怒他们 他们可都是荷枪实弹哪
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.23,1:46:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,深吸一口气 好好找找看你的胆量在哪里 因为你会需要的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.73,1:46:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这语气好熟悉 只是从一个 有头发的人嘴里说出来感觉好像…怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.36,1:47:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.61,1:47:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计15分钟到达
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.17,1:47:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.83,1:48:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄好它
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.66,1:48:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？我一弄好你就会杀了我 这点我清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.72,1:48:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.01,1:48:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会这么做的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.19,1:48:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 不要不要 可恶！- 罗宾森好像开得太快了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.02,1:48:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 你说什么？- 有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.27,1:48:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗宾森开得太快了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.70,1:48:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是罗宾森
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.74,1:48:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.09,1:49:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗来迪？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.13,1:49:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗来迪？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.80,1:49:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 约翰·麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.68,1:49:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你能听到 这是你的频率 对吧？666
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.31,1:49:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 拿起麦克风 弗来迪
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.73,1:49:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有你要找的人 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.15,1:49:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋黑客！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.28,1:49:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,“法师”
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.41,1:49:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你尽一切可能帮我联络上FBI
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.75,1:49:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我联络上副局长伯曼
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.83,1:49:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗？- 你是认真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.50,1:49:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我这样用黑的方法给你去接通
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.13,1:49:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI网络犯罪小组的头头？开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.26,1:49:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗来迪 该死 他们抓了我女儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.01,1:49:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你 稍等
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.86,1:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是中心 有人要找伯曼主任
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.70,1:50:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 中心找你
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.03,1:50:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.12,1:50:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯曼 我是麦克连 - 麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.66,1:50:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 盖布尔在往北的695公路上 他开的是运危险物质的公用车
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.63,1:50:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 盖布尔已经离开乌德隆了？我们正赶往那里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.67,1:50:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯曼 他们抓了我女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.51,1:50:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 这辆运危险物质的车是政府公用的 所以应该有防盗追踪系统 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.26,1:50:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到那台车就可以追踪到盖布尔
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.56,1:50:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我车牌号 - 好 等一下 记好了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.19,1:50:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,G…T…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.86,1:50:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,5…9…2…N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.07,1:50:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,记下了 麦克连 法瑞尔在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.78,1:50:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.20,1:50:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.78,1:51:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进去救露西 可如果我有什么不测的话
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.33,1:51:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须派援军进去 听到没？派所有人进去
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.96,1:51:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让那疯子抓走我女儿 你听到没？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.21,1:51:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 别担心 - 我要你向我保证 伯曼
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.97,1:51:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.43,1:51:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连回话完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.52,1:51:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,F-35来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.32,1:51:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你破解攻击指令密码了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.69,1:51:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特雷？攻击指令密码破解了吗？- 是 破解了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.20,1:51:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我和飞行员说话
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.95,1:51:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.46,1:51:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在隔离他的无线电讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.85,1:52:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在向他发送攻击指令
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.73,1:52:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,AV-81
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.07,1:52:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- AV-81，这里是海军陆战队空翼航空指挥中心 - AV-81听命
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.49,1:52:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已确定你防区内有搭载恐怖分子的车辆行驶 是一台大型货柜车
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.62,1:52:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现正在追逐一辆危险物品运输车 - 我看到了 指挥中心
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.62,1:52:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在有权对其进行攻击并摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.46,1:52:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 AV-81开始进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.13,1:52:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.23,1:52:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.52,1:52:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打错人了！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.41,1:53:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 我想你爸爸大概不会来了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.21,1:53:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.31,1:54:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这两下子而已？呃？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.60,1:54:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的完美一击吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.31,1:54:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.41,1:55:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.09,1:55:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.35,1:57:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.40,1:57:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走 这边 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.49,1:57:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三分钟后就离开
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.41,1:57:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一分钟时间
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.83,1:57:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则还是没变啊 我一解开密码你就会杀了我的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.17,1:57:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 他妈的！他妈的！- 马修？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.84,1:57:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.18,1:57:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要你专心一些
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.10,1:57:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 规则永远都可以改变 - 好 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.93,1:57:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在十秒钟内就要对她开枪了 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.39,1:57:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,9…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.35,1:57:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.02,1:57:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,8…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.11,1:57:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.69,1:57:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.03,1:57:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.16,1:58:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.70,1:58:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,6…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.37,1:58:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！停！我做！我做！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.38,1:58:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我的上帝呀
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.52,1:58:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦探员朝这边过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.98,1:58:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把所有东西都装上飞机 - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.74,1:58:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸！- 小心
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.78,1:58:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 宝贝 一切都会没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.29,1:58:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.09,1:58:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.21,1:58:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.57,1:59:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.70,1:59:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.95,1:59:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这回抓住她了？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.54,1:59:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.54,1:59:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她倒是勇气可嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.79,1:59:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马修！- 哦 该死 好 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.96,1:59:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做 我做
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.68,1:59:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.77,1:59:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我个忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.02,1:59:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你快不行了 不过你再撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.07,1:59:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等马特做完了 我就杀了他 再杀了你女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.36,2:00:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我真得很希望你能看到这一幕
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.83,2:00:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 马修？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.37,2:00:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给十秒行吗？再过十秒你就能有所有的钱了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.96,2:00:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以离开 没人必须要受伤 好吗？- 再过几秒 你给我待好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.13,2:00:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.29,2:00:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我待好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.88,2:00:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.51,2:00:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的墓碑上应该这么写 “总是在错误的时间出现在错误的地方”
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.56,2:00:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如写“爽死啦！操你…”
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.24,2:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸…爸…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.03,2:00:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 是的 宝贝儿 我挺好的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.25,2:00:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会来救我
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.87,2:00:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会来救你的 宝贝 抱歉我用了这么久才救你出来 我没事的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.47,2:01:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.18,2:01:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.89,2:01:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等！都是自己人
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.77,2:01:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到车那边去 - 绕过去！绕过去！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.53,2:01:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 扶爸爸起来 - 好
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.74,2:01:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！等会儿 等会儿 我看我还是先坐在这里休息一下好了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.53,2:01:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 爸 你真是疯了 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.75,2:01:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开枪打你自己诶！- 在当时是个不错的想法
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.67,2:01:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉这些人我这么做了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.14,2:01:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你帮了我们 约翰 - 别客气
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.90,2:01:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.90,2:02:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该把手举起来吗？- 不 不用举手
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.82,2:02:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就放下面点儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.24,2:02:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会在前往医院的途中休克死亡
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.29,2:02:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.16,2:02:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.79,2:02:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 哦 嘿！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.05,2:02:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中弹的感觉怎么样？- 其实还不错
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.76,2:02:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我打了一些…叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.19,2:02:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吗啡 - 吗啡
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.26,2:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 你现在也有了“功绩勋章”了 - 是么 可我还不知道它能意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.02,2:02:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有就是 女人们喜欢男人的疤痕 - 真的？嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.52,2:02:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了那个以外
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.61,2:02:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你想都别想
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.48,2:02:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在想什么？她对你说了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.32,2:02:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我们好像有点…来电… - 别想太多 那只是吗啡在作怪
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.95,2:02:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.45,2:02:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 在我们一起经历这么多事后 我真不想因为这个再痛扁你一顿
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.29,2:03:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的确不太好
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.88,2:03:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以走了吗？- 是 都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.80,2:03:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好保重 咱们医院见
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.39,2:03:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.14,2:03:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你救了我女儿的命 - 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.65,2:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.48,2:03:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才能成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.65,2:03:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.41,2:03:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 嗯 他有提到我吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.21,2:03:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天哪 露西
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.34,2:03:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？对不起 我只是问问
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.05,2:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在已经够痛苦的了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.55,2:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去医院吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sending you the code。- Yes，I see that。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:00:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about my account？- Delivering.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just sent it。You should have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。Thank you。- Hey，are you sure this is legal？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just running a test on our security system，sir。It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got a sexy voice。Is there anything else I can do for you？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To you？- We have all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，guess who just made 50 Gs today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What'd you do to my drive？- I didn't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't cool。Don't ever，ever touch my computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diagnostics show no damage，but this was an intentional breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We were hacked？- It wasn't 「Denial of Service」 level，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they definitely cracked our door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Open the Black Hat files.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want every hacker in the country who could have done this interviewed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，that's close to 1，000 names。This holiday weekend we're short-staffed as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're the ones supposed to keep this from happening，and it happened to us。Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，it's night。They're all over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get local law enforcement help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody out there thinks they can screw with us。I wanna find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jim！I said no。- Lucy，you're killin' me，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get out！- What？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get out of the car now！- Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No means no。- What are you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- John，stop it！- Don't call me that。I hate it when you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know this guy？- Just shut your mouth right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad！Stop it。I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「Dad」？You said your dad was dead。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You told this jerk-off I was dead？You actually said that？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may have exaggerated a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this guy's what？Your boyfriend？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.21,0:04:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，OK？I'm sorry。We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't answer your phone，return calls。- Because I'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why aren't we talking this time，Lucy？- Why not？What？You want a list？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about stuff like this：You spy on me，you drag my boyfriend out of the car…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You said he's not your boyfriend。- He's not！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I thought you said I just was。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are such an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。I'm sorry I pulled your 「not-boyfriend」 out of the car，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lucy，baby，get in the car。Let's go。- No，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will both of you go away？- Just talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm tired。I'm going to bed… alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn right you're going to bed alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucy，honey，wait a minute。I wanna talk to you。Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，when I wanna talk to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.27,0:05:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I wanna talk to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucy。Wait，Lucy。Lucy！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lucy McClane。- It's not McClane。It's Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chicks，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go。I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,John？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,John？It's Sclavino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go for McClane。- What are you doing at Rutgers？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do you know where I am？- Our cars were LoJacked four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:07:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm staring at exactly where you are。- Sir，that's not something I would turn on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we did that。John，we turned them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.47,0:07:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，the feds have called in a favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're doing a sweep。They want us to pick up some computer hacker in Camden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last name：Farrell。First name：Matthew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa。Camden？What are you telling me this for？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just came in。- Vino，it's 3am。I was on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send ajughead from the Academy。They'd be happy to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can'tjust send in a uniform。The feds demanded a senior detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.74,0:07:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The kid's a high-value subject，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just pick him up，escort him to the Hoover Building in DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,They had some kind of a computer breach there this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，give me that information。Give me that name again。What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You owe me one，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who is it？- NYPD。Open the door，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- NYPD？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Oh，I get it。Don't worry，everyone gets lost around here。Glad to help。Take…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm not lost。Are you Matthew Farrell？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。He，uh… actually does not live here any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Course not。Who are you？- My name is Daisy Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got a lot of shit for it when I was a kid。Please don't add to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can I see some identification，please？- Yeah，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，「Detective」！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that looks real！You get that at Toys 「R」 Us？Looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then of course… - Yeah。That… actually looks pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Farrell！Sully PDL-ed the new copy of the Kill Zone Nine。Wanna check it out？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Thanks，though，man。And good luck at the Bad Timing Awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I get you something？Coffee？A warrant？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this about？- I don't know。Some computer thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,DC feds wanna talk to you，so let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Feds，huh？- Yeah。The feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been White Hat for four years，but once you're on that goddamn list…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You play with dolls？- Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Could you not touch that？- Like a GI Joe？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's not。It's a limited edition…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.01,0:11:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ooh。- …and…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.59,0:11:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That supposed to come off？- No，but it's more valuable broken，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- so thanks for that。- Krazy Glue。I'm sure it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got some other cool shit you can break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go，OK？Come on。- I gotta power down my gear，OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,More dolls。Not spending a whole lot of time with the girls，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Are you really trying to escape？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ow！Jesus，don't shoot！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus Christ。- Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Come on。Low，low！Stay down！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Agh！- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。Stay low，all right？Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You stay with me，all right？Here we go。- OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll wake the neighbours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Get inside！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're back in the room！They're back in the room！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you nuts？Get outta there right now！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm trying to… - Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back in there！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aaargh！Argh！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the hell was that？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you do that？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shit。- I didn't do that。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shit。- Stay close。The whole apartment's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.43,0:15:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go。Come on，let's go，goddammit！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.27,0:15:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.40,0:15:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it。Slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，let's go。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on。Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay with me。Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go。Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in the car。Go，go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kid，can you reload a gun？- What？Me？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you reload a gun？！- I…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the glove box and get a magazine out right now！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grab the gun from the back seat！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus！Is the circus in town？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you see that？- Yeah，I saw it。I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Camden base，10077。Come back。Camden base，10077.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to speak to your chief of your detectives。Police emergency，asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is Chief Detective Wiesman。- This is Detective John McClane，NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police emergency。I wanna report a police shooting in yourjurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- What's the status？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thomas。We had a problem in New Jersey。Farrell's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So he got away。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did send five of you，is that right？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sending a chopper。Get airborne and we'll track 'em down。Think you can handle that？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God。- Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am breathing！I'm-I'm… I can't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the adrenaline。You're just scared。It'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm scared！Weren't you scared，back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？This is you being scared？I don't know，cos you seem really calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you done stuff like that before？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stuff like what？- Like killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。But not for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So who were those guys，huh？Why were they trying to kill you？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did they blow up my goddamn apartment？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were there to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:20:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why would they want to kill me？- You tell me，kid。You're the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got seven dead hackers so far，none of whom were high on our list.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get the hard drives，start sweepin' 'em。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trey。Matthew Farrell，find him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with all the guns？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Operational prudence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think of them as hardware to your software.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:21:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，DC！It's shaping up to be a beautiful Fourth of July weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you've got any big plans，get started early，cos the traffic is ramping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,So here's another golden oldie for all the commuters out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What… What…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？What is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's Creedence。- Creedence？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Creedence。Creedence Clearwater Revival？Classic rock？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know who it is。It's old rock。Doesn't make it classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What sucked then sucks now。- You don't like Creedence？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is like having a pine cone shoved in my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.70,0:21:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Really？Wow，that's mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。I'm cooperating with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're at a heading of 060。Making another pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.88,0:21:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen up，everyone。Are we ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transportation hubs are prepped and set.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Begin stage one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,When'd you last turn on the radio and listen to popular music？Just give me a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.35,0:22:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The '70s？I'm guessing。Was Michael Jackson still black？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pearl Jam。I'll go back ten years with you。Ten years.20 years。The Cure？Nothin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's called news radio。I want to see if your friends from Camden made the headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on。You listen to the news？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a problem with the news now？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I got a big goddamn problem with the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.75,0:23:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready for this？The news is completely manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything you hear，every single day，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,is designed by corporate media to do one thing only：To keep you living in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，fear？- Total fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you'll go out and spend money on things you probably don't even need，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,so advertisers keep buying ads on their stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you one more thing。I'll do this all day。I got days of data at home…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.23,0:23:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- I'll drop a bomb on you…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey！- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut up。- That's good。Be dismissive instead of…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right？- No，I'm not all right！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay in the car。You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？Don't move。Just call 911，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.88,0:24:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.95,0:25:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All the lights are green。- Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.58,0:25:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the lights are green。Let's go。Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.33,0:25:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We gotta go？- Get your bag，hack-boy。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。- I've never been in a car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's very exciting。This way，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.84,0:25:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You been in a car accident？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.76,0:25:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a little thing they invented in the '60s called jogging。You're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.03,0:25:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，Chicago's reporting a systems crash on the el train network.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amtrak is flashing a level-one crash in their com system.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,FAAjust issued a critical alert。Their ATC netjust went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.50,0:25:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，let's get 'em outside for a little fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.06,0:26:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the anthrax alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.15,0:26:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，everyone out。Now！Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.82,0:26:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Taylor，move！Go！Move！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate and proceed to the transportation shuttles immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.01,0:26:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.09,0:26:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate and proceed to the transportation shuttles immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.33,0:27:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need you inside，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.09,0:27:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take your team。I want men on the fourth floor，got it？Masks on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.01,0:27:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta know what's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run a trunk search on these data crashes，try to ID the point of origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.10,0:27:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Begin stage two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.49,0:27:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're already starting to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.33,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,They think that someone's taking their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.96,0:28:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,All those nickels and dimes they saved had meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Useful idiots」，as Lenin would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prep the video package.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,DC transportation system's crashing and they just hit the financial sector。All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.66,0:28:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me the secretary for trans and treasury on the line and the chairman of the SEC.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，people。Somewhere somebody left a digital fingerprint。Find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.58,0:28:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Deputy Director Bowman in here？- Not now。It'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not today。This is Matthew Farrell。I brought him here on orders from Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.17,0:28:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't know what's goin' on，find somebody that does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Video package is ready for upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，I appreciate your bringing Farrell，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we are neck-deep in damage control right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.32,0:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。I'm sorry，sir。Do you have anything to eat，any snacks around？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.57,0:29:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd love… I've got really low blood sugar…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- No？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.08,0:29:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,As if the transportation breakdown and anthrax scares weren't enough for one day，
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.13,0:29:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,the stock market found itself in a selling frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.30,0:29:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,The FTC believes this panic might have been triggered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,by a computer malfunction in the stock exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.76,0:29:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，that is all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.98,0:29:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not as bad as it looks。We run drills to prepare for things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- These your suspects？- Were.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All seven were killed in the last 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.53,0:29:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Recognise any of these people？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not one？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:30:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，we got a system error.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.34,0:30:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,My fellow Americans… …it is time to…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.89,0:30:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,strike… fear… into… the hearts of… citizenry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.06,0:30:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ask not… - That's an unauthorised broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.64,0:30:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what your country can do… to avert… this… crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.73,0:30:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer is… …nothing whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our military… strength… is… in this case…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.19,0:30:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Read my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,The… great… confident… roar… of… American… progress… and… growth…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.66,0:30:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,has come to… an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.41,0:30:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the… vital… technology… that… this nation… holds dear…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.67,0:30:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,all… communications… transportation… the internet… connectivity…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.88,0:30:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,electrical… power… critical… utilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.55,0:31:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,their… fate… now… rests… in… our… hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will not tire，we will not falter，
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.52,0:31:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we will not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how they're getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.23,0:31:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.19,0:31:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a… happy Independence Day… to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.66,0:31:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried to find more Nixon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think they bought it？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.04,0:31:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，I want telecom，transportation…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.34,0:31:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus Christ，it's a fire sale。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a fire sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.93,0:31:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。We don't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.39,0:31:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a myth，anyway。It can't be done。- It's a myth？Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.72,0:31:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please tell me she's not in charge of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.35,0:31:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's a fire sale？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a three-step systematic attack on the entire national infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.94,0:31:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step one：Take out transportation。Step two：The financial base and telecoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:32:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step three：Get rid of all the utilities，gas，water，electric，nuclear…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.41,0:32:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything that's run by computers，which today is almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.95,0:32:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why they call it a fire sale，everything must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.12,0:32:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen… What's your name？Farrell？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.71,0:32:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down，OK？No one here's talking about a fire sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.96,0:32:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not unless you're telling me you helped plan one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.09,0:32:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，man。I'm just saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Appreciate your concern。We're on it。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.22,0:32:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You've done a bang-up job so far。- What？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.27,0:32:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。I said I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。They didn't send the girl scouts out to get this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,They sent professional guys，full tactical gear。They blew the whole joint up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.61,0:32:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I don't know this kid，and frankly I don't give a shit，no offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.49,0:32:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,but somebody wants this kid dead，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.83,0:32:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,and obviously it's got something to do with whatever's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Homeland's interrogating the hackers we're bringing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.67,0:32:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get you an escort over there。All right？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:33:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Molina，get this kid to the front of the line。I wanna know what he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.13,0:33:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he knew half the shit I know，his head would explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.85,0:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Special Agent Johnson。We'll take the sedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Agent Johnson？- That's right。Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。So is any of that actually possible，what you were saying back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.65,0:33:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it possible？Look，you take out any one thing，the system can recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you take it all down at once，the system crashes and… Look around，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Government's gotta have dozens of departments dedicated to that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.54,0:33:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It took FEMA five days to get water to the Superdome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:34:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long till we get to DHS？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.57,0:34:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laughlin，get on the DC police band and get 'em to clear a route to DHS for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.45,0:34:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,DC Metro，this is the FBI requesting you to clear a route…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Farrell just resurfaced on the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.33,0:34:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Feds are taking him to Homeland。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.71,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Close that loop，now。- Isolate the frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.59,0:34:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get us a location on the vehicles and pull me up a file on this John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rand，we just found Farrell。Stand by for a location.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mean to harp，but we just passed another Arby's，and I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.56,0:34:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I could eat a wrapper。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.81,0:34:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I could just get some ketchup packets。- Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.11,0:34:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got about 14 minutes to tell me why you lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.99,0:34:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lied to you？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The pictures on the wall，you knew those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.91,0:34:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't… - Kid，don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.62,0:34:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a cop。I can tell you're lying。Who were they？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.67,0:35:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。OK，OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.63,0:35:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were my competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make the next right onto Concord.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.72,0:35:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,They said they'd developed a mutating encryption algorithm
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.14,0:35:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they wanted to see if it could be cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I do。I do math-based security.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.40,0:35:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's the thing。To pull off something as massive and crazy as a fire sale，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.16,0:35:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,you need tons of guys to write programs，but only a few Black Hats to implement it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,At that point the start-up guys，who haven't really done anything wrong，like me…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.04,0:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would end up as pictures on some guy's wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.58,0:35:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear to God，McClane，I swear to you I had no idea I was gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.59,0:35:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,an accessory to Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.68,0:35:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the next left at Lexington.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.76,0:35:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's a sexy voice。What's she taking us this way for？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Unit 510。- Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.77,0:36:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear a route for two FBI vehicles approaching on Concord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.98,0:36:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy，dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Her who？- What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.07,0:36:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's them。- You're saying it's them them？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.45,0:36:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I swear to you I know her。I would know her voice anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.45,0:36:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，don't say anything… - Just keep your mouth shut for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Metro，how's your day goin' over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.71,0:36:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta be pretty crazy over there，what with all those 587s，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.21,0:36:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。We've had to dispatch all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had to dispatch all units for all the naked people walking around？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.60,0:36:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut the bullshit，honey，and just put your boss on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.35,0:36:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Laughlin，we're getting off this route。Turn left on 14th Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.45,0:36:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Officer McClane。- It's Detective McClane，asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.54,0:37:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。We'll have plenty of time to get to know each other when I visit you in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.83,0:37:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，John，I already know so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your address in Brooklyn，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.46,0:37:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,the payments on your mortgage，how long you've been a member of the NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.22,0:37:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And how's Holly？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，that's sad。You're divorced。Was that tough on little Jack and Lucy？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.31,0:37:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，this is sad。After 30 years I thought you'd have a better pension plan annuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.73,0:37:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.90,0:37:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your 401k no longer exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.07,0:37:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell you what。Let me make it up to you。- Box them in at that intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.58,0:37:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot Mr Farrell in the head and drive away，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.75,0:37:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,and by the time you reach the end of the next block
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,all your debts will be wiped clean and your children will be set for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.21,0:37:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，that really is tempting，especially that last part，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.88,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I think I'm gonna have to pass，jerk-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，you're a Timex watch in a digital age.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.43,0:38:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.35,0:38:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，the other thing that could happen is I could come and find you，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.32,0:38:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,kick your ass and throw you out of your own party。What about that？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.99,0:38:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.61,0:38:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.62,0:38:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Get right down！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay down！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Officers down at the corner of Main and Constitution。Officers down！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.40,0:39:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on，get out！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.78,0:39:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddammit！Just stay down！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.50,0:39:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Just hang on！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Base，we've got a squad car under fire！We need backup！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is base。We're sending backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.15,0:39:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.67,0:39:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.56,0:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.86,0:40:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.54,0:40:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We lost the tail。- Stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.13,0:40:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're back。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the tunnel。Left！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.94,0:40:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，what are you… Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.57,0:41:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring up the schematics on that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.78,0:41:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tunnel！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the gates on the north side entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.43,0:41:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Redirect traffic to occupy all lanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now open the other side。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.39,0:41:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.94,0:41:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.27,0:42:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Don't get out of the car！Hey！Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.40,0:42:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay there！Stand still！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.75,0:42:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run。Run！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.09,0:43:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.76,0:43:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.52,0:43:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right？- Yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.19,0:43:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just stay here。Stay right here for a minute。- What？！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.49,0:43:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「It can't be a uniform，John。No.」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.91,0:43:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get over to the wall，sir！「Feds called in a favour.」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.24,0:43:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「All you gotta do is go pick up a kid down in Jersey，drive him down to DC.」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「How hard can that be，huh？It can't be that hard，can it？」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.84,0:43:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「No，gotta be a senior detective.」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.55,0:43:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think a traffic jam，throwing a car at me's gonna stop me？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.89,0:43:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rand，get in there and get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.70,0:44:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't touch me，don't touch me。- OK，sorry，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.58,0:44:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you OK？Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.62,0:45:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Pretty lucky shot，huh？- Oh，yeah，lucky。That was…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.42,0:45:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just killed a helicopter with a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.75,0:45:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was out of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.76,0:45:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How you doin'？- I skinned my knee，my asthma's acting up…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.31,0:45:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whatever。Yeah，I'm fine。- Give me a hand。Don'tjump outta cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.36,0:45:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rand，check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.03,0:45:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about Farrell and McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.21,0:45:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.41,0:45:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，we're moving on。Begin stage three.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.63,0:45:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just spoke to Emerson。The team's arriving at Woodlawn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.17,0:45:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good。Mai，get ready for the downloads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.43,0:46:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,ID，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.02,0:46:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Park behind the transpo。We'll lead you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man the gate。You're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.53,0:46:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anthrax alarms only went off on five floors。Below that you'll need DOD clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.58,0:46:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why you'd need to go further。There's nothin' down there but servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.59,0:46:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go again。Rodriguez！I didn't copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.27,0:46:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Gate secured。- Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.83,0:47:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，we are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.78,0:47:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.07,0:47:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey，this is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.11,0:47:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，there's tough and there's stupid。You gotta go to a hospital。Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a doctor，but you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。Sexy，right？- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.25,0:47:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.63,0:47:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a doctor。We need the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.53,0:48:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.99,0:48:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta the way！Make a hole，please。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.87,0:48:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out！Excuse me！Excuse me！Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.50,0:48:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,NYPD。All right？I got this kid。Come on。Let's go，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.13,0:48:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.01,0:48:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,NYPD。NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.51,0:48:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.68,0:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sergeant？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.97,0:48:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sergeant！I need to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.06,0:48:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The medic's in the back。- I'm all right。NYPD。I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.07,0:49:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.53,0:49:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sergeant！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.37,0:49:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.25,0:49:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.35,0:49:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Siamo pronti.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.47,0:49:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.48,0:49:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Launch the downloads.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.15,0:49:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nothing's happening。- Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.95,0:49:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't know。It's not responding。- Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.58,0:50:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.84,0:50:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tell me when the download reaches 20%。- OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.97,0:50:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.10,0:50:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me！Thank you。- Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.36,0:50:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kid？Kid，hey！- Yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.69,0:50:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got a phone in that bag？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.32,0:50:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.62,0:50:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And here you go，Agent… Tovarek。Guess that's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.81,0:50:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Download's at 20%。- Time to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.06,0:51:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's keep them chasing their tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.00,0:51:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Due to recent activity，law enforcement agencies are being cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.04,0:51:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are telling drivers to abandon their vehicles until they are searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.59,0:51:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，as you can see，canine units are checking each vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.68,0:51:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whether this is connected to the anthrax reports we heard earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,or a new terrorist threat，we do not know…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.68,0:51:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- FAAjust grounded all flights。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.18,0:51:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have complete access over networks，phones，power grids，water，nuclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.81,0:51:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，excuse me。- Jack Parry，NSA.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.11,0:51:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chuck Summer，DHS liaison。White House made the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.95,0:51:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anything you need，we're here to help。- Help？Wow，that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.95,0:52:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna need some work space for our people。What can you do for us？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.79,0:52:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you can see，we're using the space，so you guys can stand in the corner and… liaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.13,0:52:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I need something，I'll just wave to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.90,0:52:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait！No，don't call。- What are you talkin' about？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.86,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,They probably cracked that hours ago。They could trace us。Put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.66,0:52:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You sure？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or… smash it。You didn't have to smash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.87,0:52:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me。It's a police emergency。- Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.71,0:52:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll call you right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.84,0:52:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，right in here。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.67,0:52:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got a signal？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.09,0:52:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- This is John McClane for Agent Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.35,0:53:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，John McClane is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.97,0:53:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McClane，go。- We never made it to DHS.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.31,0:53:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They came after the kid again。All your men are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.69,0:53:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about Farrell？- I got him with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.65,0:53:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- Hang on，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.82,0:53:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'll hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.49,0:53:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another day in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.20,0:53:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They just swarmed into everything，the telecom system，phones，cells，satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.89,0:53:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're blanketing every station.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.75,0:54:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you put the news back on？- This is the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.20,0:54:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's on every channel。- Been this way for a few minutes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.44,0:54:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.33,0:54:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.25,0:54:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.00,0:54:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.17,0:54:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bowman？Bowman，do you see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bowman，it's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.89,0:55:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.43,0:55:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.89,0:55:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.81,0:55:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- McClane？- Bowman！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.36,0:55:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Satellite's down。Get me a land line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.00,0:55:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wrote one little piece of code and the world falls apart。This is virtual terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- You know，it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.76,0:55:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first time I heard of the concept of a fire sale
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.55,0:55:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I actually thought it would be cool if anyone ever really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.64,0:55:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just hit the reset button and melt the system just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.52,0:55:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，it's not a system。It's a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.03,0:56:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're talkin' about people，a whole country full of people，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.40,0:56:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,sitting at home alone，scared to death in their houses，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.03,0:56:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,So finish your nostalgic moment and think a little bit and help me catch these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.37,0:56:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just help me。Just put yourself in their shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.50,0:56:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。If this were your fire sale，what would be your next move？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.34,0:56:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，uh，well，the whole point of a fire sale is that it's mostly done by remote，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.22,0:56:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not everything is run completely online。Major utilities aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.31,0:56:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're run by closed circuits，so you could breach the security，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.27,0:56:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,but to shut it down you'd have to physically go there。You'd have to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.52,0:56:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.28,0:56:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me that guy's PDA。- Phones are all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's the network that's dead。I've just gotta reprogram it and link it into the old Satcoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.58,0:56:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hackers surf 'em all the time。Probably what these guys are using to talk to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.25,0:56:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know all this stuff？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dude，I don't know。There's a lot rattling around up there。I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.50,0:57:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。National power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.34,0:57:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gas and electric is divided into three zones，Eastern，Central，Western…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.97,0:57:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,each with a primary hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.60,0:57:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.85,0:57:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are we looking at？- That is the Eastern hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.73,0:57:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，they take this out，wipes out all the power for the entire Eastern Corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.32,0:57:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，again，you'd have to do it manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.86,0:57:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- OK。Come on。Let's go。- What？To West Virginia？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.91,0:57:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I honestly don't think I can handle any more people trying to kill me。McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.00,0:57:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You get used to it。- McClane。Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.37,0:57:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，wireless networks are down and I think they're hitting the land lines，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.09,0:57:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care how，you find me a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.30,0:57:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，what you got？- We swept the building。Seems clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.68,0:57:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We can sweep it again… - Don't bother。Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.43,0:57:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a fake。This guy's playin' us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.85,0:58:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，get everyone back inside the crisis centre now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.60,0:58:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，let's open it up！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.15,0:58:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，get in。- Door's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.69,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless you have an extra gun I can use to unlock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.91,0:58:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey，don't do that！You're gonna disable it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was crazy。Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.29,0:58:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about that，man。I didn't know it'd come out so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.76,0:58:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，this is a pain in the ass。How'd you do yours？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.35,0:58:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？What？Did it hit you a little bit？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.52,0:58:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.40,0:58:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，please don't touch those，OK？I know what I'm doing。I've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.82,0:58:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，I've read about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.74,0:58:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,RoadAssist。We've detected an air-bag deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.86,0:58:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes… Please，we just hit a tree and my… my dad is having a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.49,0:59:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he's gonna die。You need to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.04,0:59:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold while we contact emergency services.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.92,0:59:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！He's dying！I can get him to a hospital。I can drive。I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.09,0:59:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can't really turn the key，so you gotta start the car for us，OK？Please，Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.22,0:59:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your name，please？- I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is… Frank，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.89,0:59:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my dad's name is，um… is…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.94,0:59:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dvorak… Tsajanski.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.53,0:59:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please… Please，just help us。We need your help。Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.45,0:59:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Emergency services are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.74,0:59:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，listen to me。Ma'am，what is your name？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.62,0:59:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dolores。- Dolores？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.41,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，Dolores，I don't know if you have a dad，but I do，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I wanna be able to say that a year from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.17,0:59:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because my dad is my hero，and right now he is in my arms dying，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.26,0:59:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and his only hope is to get to a hospital right now。We can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.59,0:59:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,So please start the goddamn car！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.39,1:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Dolores.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.27,1:00:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pass the PDA。I gotta call the Warlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.81,1:00:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The what？- The Warlock。A digital Jedi。He's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.17,1:00:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ma'am，you're not authorised to be here。- FBI。We suspect a security breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't land here without authorisa…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.36,1:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was pretty good back there，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.20,1:00:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.82,1:01:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you？Nothing else to complain about？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.62,1:01:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.20,1:01:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，what？What's the matter you？- I'm not like you。I can't do this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.00,1:01:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that mean？Like what？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.63,1:01:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not，like，heroic and everything。I'm not brave like you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.47,1:01:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not that guy。- I'm nobody's hero，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.26,1:01:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've saved my life，like，ten times in six hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.97,1:01:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just doing my job，that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.73,1:01:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Know what you get for being a hero？Nothing。You get shot at.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.69,1:01:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get a little pat on the back，blah-blah-blah。Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.40,1:01:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get divorced.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.74,1:01:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,A wife that can't remember your last name.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.91,1:01:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your kids don't wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.58,1:01:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get to eat a lot of meals by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.83,1:01:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me，kid，nobody wants to be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.96,1:02:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then why are you doin' this？- Cos there's nobody else to do it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.01,1:02:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there was somebody else to do it，I would let them do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.18,1:02:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there's not。So we're doin' it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.81,1:02:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.06,1:02:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's what makes you that guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.24,1:02:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thing's flying now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.32,1:02:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Contact Emerson。Tell him we'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.91,1:02:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？This whole floor's restricted acc…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.23,1:03:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.68,1:03:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.28,1:03:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're in。- Good。Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.76,1:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess you were right，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.05,1:04:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，that's… awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.01,1:04:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.69,1:04:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How would they shut down a power grid？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.19,1:04:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。- Uh… Central control room。OK…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.87,1:04:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh，fourth floor。Fourth floor。- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.45,1:04:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You take the right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.96,1:04:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.00,1:04:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.47,1:04:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can we stop for… - Try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.63,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am！I just wanna stop for two seconds to catch our breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，they have these things called gymnasiums.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.05,1:05:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Intel's fairly certain the terrorists are mobile.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.85,1:05:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the only way to avoid signal triangulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.81,1:05:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the amount of hardware they're running，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.31,1:05:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're probably looking for a large vehicle，most likely a semitrailer rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.06,1:05:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Tell the guys at Homeland Security
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.86,1:05:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,we need every agent，satellite and functioning network they got。Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.13,1:06:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Play time's over，sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.93,1:06:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.18,1:06:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take your hand off the gun。Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.43,1:06:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.65,1:06:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，kid。You're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.98,1:06:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.24,1:06:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,As fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.91,1:06:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.84,1:06:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's enough of this kung fu shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.01,1:07:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've known some bitches in my day，but you are maybe the…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.56,1:07:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still awake，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.65,1:07:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just keep doin' what you're doin'。- OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.98,1:07:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How much time do you need？- Um… Not much.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.20,1:07:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.92,1:07:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you done？- I，uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.59,1:07:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you done？- No，not quite.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.59,1:07:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- I'm not exactly checking my email here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.93,1:07:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,They used VM mode，so I'm isolating their API and booting the host.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？！- It means about 30 seconds，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.93,1:07:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the easiest thing to do when…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.07,1:08:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Undo everything you just did。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.95,1:08:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。OK，OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.91,1:08:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a righty，I'm a righty。I need my other hand，I really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.04,1:08:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a righty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.91,1:08:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,One last door to open.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.87,1:08:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what you're doing？Do you realise what this'll do to the country？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.96,1:09:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I do。Now open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，good。Glad we're on the same page.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.14,1:09:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do？I'm glad you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.87,1:09:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.84,1:09:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.79,1:10:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，let's just talk about this for one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.46,1:11:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doin'？That's not too tight，is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.51,1:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.43,1:11:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smile pretty！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.26,1:11:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.68,1:11:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.10,1:11:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane，get out of there！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.85,1:12:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，man！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.38,1:12:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.97,1:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you stopped it，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.05,1:12:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，a gun to your head makes it harder to do this kind of work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.51,1:12:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- I know that comes as a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.81,1:12:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can't you just turn it off？Lock 'em out？- I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.57,1:12:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might be able to slow 'em down，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.20,1:12:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Western and Central hubs are ours。We're just waiting on Mai's end.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.58,1:13:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。Something's up。All the security's reactivating.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.46,1:13:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think someone might be in the market for some cheap Viagra.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.59,1:13:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now your girlfriend's dead，why don't you check out our sexy singles？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.13,1:13:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an e-bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.56,1:13:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.19,1:13:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，wait，wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mai，talk to me。What's going on？- Mai？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，little Asian chick，likes to kick people？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think she's gonna be talking to anybody for a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.08,1:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last time I saw her，she was at the bottom of an elevator shaft with an SUV up her ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.38,1:13:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter？Cat got your tongue？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，jackass。Your fire sale is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.89,1:14:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just pack up your little circus or I'm gonna come and I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.43,1:14:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no idea who I am or what I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.65,1:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I'm finished here，and I promise it'll be soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.40,1:14:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will focus all my attention… on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna make things personal，fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.34,1:14:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reroute every cubic foot of natural gas in the pipelines to that station.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.39,1:14:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you get Bowman on this thing？- Sure。I can get anyone on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.11,1:14:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.36,1:14:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now？- Yeah，now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.86,1:15:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.78,1:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's Thomas Gabriel。- Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.45,1:15:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know this guy？- I worked with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.79,1:15:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was DOD's chief programmer for infrastructure security.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.42,1:15:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,After 9/11，he's the guy that told Joint Chiefs the system was vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.55,1:15:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted an overhaul，but they wouldn't listen。Gabriel's not people-friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think so？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,When he tried to go public，they crucified him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.76,1:15:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Destroyed his reputation，froze assets。After that he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.06,1:15:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a pretty serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.56,1:15:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on one minute。What？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.81,1:15:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we need to get out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.94,1:15:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're sending the gas lines here。- Gas lines？What gas lines？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.57,1:15:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.32,1:15:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh… all of them。See that，those flashing arrows？That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.54,1:15:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All that's coming here？- Yeah。I think we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I gotta go。Just find Thomas Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.67,1:15:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane？McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.17,1:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now。Finish it up，come on！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.66,1:16:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.17,1:17:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.67,1:17:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。We gotta get outta here。- What is the point？Man，what is the point？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.88,1:17:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，knock that off，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.26,1:17:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,This has something to do with that code you wrote for them。Think。Come on，help us win.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.93,1:17:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Win？When do we start winning？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.77,1:17:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look around。Are you out of your mind？Does it look like we're close to winning？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.19,1:17:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just got the shit kicked out of us！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I'm holding out on you？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.95,1:17:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I knew what they wanted，I would tell you！I would happily tell you！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.62,1:17:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.66,1:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Warlock。The Warlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.74,1:18:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。Ah！There goes the cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.87,1:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They knocked satellites out of the skies？- No，your battery ran out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.58,1:18:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We should go see him。- Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.46,1:18:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Warlock。We should drive to his house in Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.34,1:18:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can't go to the Warlock's house now。- Hey！This is me helping you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.22,1:18:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK？Trust me。We gotta go see the Warlock。That's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.93,1:19:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do you feel about flying？- Uh，about what？Like，with a pilot？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.53,1:19:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just stick it in the round thing。- What brown thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.37,1:19:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，put these on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.24,1:19:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stick it in there。That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.91,1:19:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You OK？- Uh，yeah，I'm just kind of afraid of flying.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.00,1:19:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I used to be terrified of flying。- Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.54,1:19:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I took some lessons。Face your fears，that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.09,1:19:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？Did it help？- Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.93,1:19:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is it supposed to make that sound？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe we should just drive。- Take it easy。Taking off's the hardest part.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.11,1:19:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I heard…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.73,1:19:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To be honest，I missed a couple of classes。- Ha，ha，ha！You did？Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.32,1:19:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you have your licence，right？I mean，you can fly one of these things？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.82,1:20:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，God。- Hey-hey，here we go！We're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.67,1:20:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good。That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.84,1:20:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，look at that。This whole area's blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,How we gonna find Warlock's house？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.43,1:20:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，it's probably gonna be the one with the lights still on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.57,1:20:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Power outage keeps spreading。About half the East Coast has already gone down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.95,1:20:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Put everything on emergency generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.53,1:20:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,How the hell are they getting past us？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.75,1:20:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Down there，down there。I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.96,1:20:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Down there？- Left。Down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.55,1:20:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Are we gonna land down there？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.34,1:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right，hang on。- OK，OK。Ohhh！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.47,1:21:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fence。Fence。Fence！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.77,1:21:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fence。Fence！- I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.10,1:21:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.73,1:21:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ow！Ohhh！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.53,1:21:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，Jesus。- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.54,1:21:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。Oh，「Taking off's the hardest part.」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.08,1:21:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.21,1:21:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，there's something you need to know about Warlock。He hates cops，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.22,1:21:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So just let me do all the talking，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.31,1:21:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.31,1:21:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mrs Kaludis.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.69,1:21:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um，is Freddy home？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.32,1:22:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Matt Farrell and this is，uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.45,1:22:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.32,1:22:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're friends from… Space Camp。I went to Space Camp with Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.75,1:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.79,1:22:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Freddy？- You got company！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.93,1:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frederick！Didn't you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.18,1:22:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,All Baltimore heard you，Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.31,1:22:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your friends are here。- Friends？What the？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.14,1:22:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Ma！How many times I gotta tell you，don't bring people down here？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.19,1:22:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see too good。Is that a young，bearded Han Solo？You've lost so much weight！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.14,1:22:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I gained 30 pounds。Who is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.75,1:22:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，that's… - Know what？Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.48,1:22:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dude，what are you doin' here？Cos of you，I'm rocking five generators to stay online.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.23,1:22:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And since you're being hunted by assassins，this visit is not a healthy use of my time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.70,1:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And hey，don't touch that，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.70,1:23:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,CB radio？A little low-tech for you guys，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.62,1:23:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,That，my friend，is an end-of-the-world insurance system，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.33,1:23:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when the last microchip goes down，I can contact whoever's there，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.92,1:23:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,whether they be zombies or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.21,1:23:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What'd you bring your dad here for？- He's cool。He's into the gaming culture.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.55,1:23:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice poster.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.39,1:23:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，what？Like，you a big fan of the Fett？- No。I was always more of a Star Wars guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.90,1:23:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Star Wars guy。Who is this man？- He's my…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.69,1:23:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，dump truck。I'm not his dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.19,1:23:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm a cop。How 'bout that？- Oh。A cop。I'm sorry。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.32,1:23:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why'd you bring a cop into my command centre？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.74,1:23:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Command centre！It's a basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.99,1:23:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a command centre！- I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell us about Thomas Gabriel，all right？That's why we came here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.46,1:23:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thomas Gabriel。I didn't know。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.63,1:23:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out！I want you outta here，right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.05,1:23:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，calm down。Just calm down，big boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.38,1:23:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You calm down！It's my house！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.89,1:24:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna tell me what I wanna know，or I'll beat you to death in your own house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.03,1:24:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four years ago，the DOD recruits Thomas Gabriel to be a cyberspook for 'em，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.49,1:24:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,First day on the job，tells his bosses
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.70,1:24:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,this nation's security infrastructure is open to compromise.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.37,1:24:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say，「We'll take it under advisement.」 But he don't ease up cos he is committed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.67,1:24:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,So he breaks into a meeting of the Joint Chiefs of Staff，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.67,1:24:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and，with just a laptop，hacks into NORAD and shuts down our defence network.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.68,1:24:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,So they put a gun to the man's head and forced him to stop the hack.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.10,1:24:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thomas Gabriel's the guy who shut down NORAD with a laptop just to prove a point.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.35,1:24:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You think I'm scared of you？- Tell us how to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.19,1:24:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I know？He's a ghost，man。He just fell off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.44,1:24:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Another dead end。Come on。- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.74,1:24:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Warlock，a couple of weeks ago I wrote a…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.24,1:25:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,A mutating algorithmic security code，that's probably being used by Thomas Gabriel now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.95,1:25:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we know that。Yes。Can you tell us what he's using it for？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.37,1:25:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I've been trying to figure that out。Here，look.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.25,1:25:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only security system in the country that I can find
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.50,1:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,currently employing that template is the Social Security Administration.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.05,1:25:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they don't use it in the main facility。Look。They use it in this building，in Woodlawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.51,1:25:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whoa。What the hell？God！- I know，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.73,1:25:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you talkin' about？- The power consumption's off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.52,1:25:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hot。It's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.94,1:25:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are there chilling towers？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.32,1:25:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.78,1:25:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's a chilling tower？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.36,1:25:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what I've been dealing with？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.87,1:25:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Large server farms generate a lot of heat and need to be cooled.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.54,1:25:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why there？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.04,1:25:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what's in that building，but it's not Social Security numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.38,1:26:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a red flag over here！Someone's hackin' into Woodlawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.39,1:26:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honing in on the host server right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.31,1:26:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Frederick Kaludis.」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.56,1:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's have a look at him。- Fat bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.73,1:26:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.19,1:26:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is his daughter？- We just got a trace on her cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.70,1:26:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll love this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.54,1:26:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let's get a better look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.30,1:26:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Freddy？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.26,1:26:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing dickin'around inside my network？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.23,1:26:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.10,1:26:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I killed you already.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.11,1:26:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.24,1:27:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You think you can try to track where he is？- Dude，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.86,1:27:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective，covering the camera with your hand does not turn off the microphone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.20,1:27:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know I'm not as smart as you guys with all this computer shit，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.46,1:27:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,but，hey，I'm still alive，ain't I？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you got to be runnin' out of bad guys by now，right？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.22,1:27:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gabriel？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.81,1:27:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honestly，you can tell me。How does that work？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.27,1:27:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got some kind of service？Some kinda 800 number？1-800-HENCHMEN？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.15,1:27:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I bet you're still on hold with，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.61,1:27:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Can I get another dead Asian hooker bitch over here right away？」 Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.24,1:27:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,But seriously，all that kicking aside，that skinny little ninja chick，she was smokin' hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.33,1:28:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of those gotta be real hard to come by，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.71,1:28:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're impressed with yourself，aren't you？- I have my moments.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.46,1:28:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.14,1:28:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this one of them？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.52,1:28:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello？- Yes，this is Emergency Services.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.48,1:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank God。- Can she hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.40,1:28:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Lucy Gennero。I'm stuck in here。My cell's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.19,1:28:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can she hear this？Lucy，hang up that phone！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.11,1:28:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，calm down，miss。We know exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.37,1:28:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything is gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.33,1:28:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lucy，hang up the phone！- John，I'm trying to have a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.75,1:28:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're a bit overloaded tonight，as you may imagine，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.84,1:28:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I assure you we're gonna get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.46,1:28:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Even if I have to come down there myself。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.88,1:28:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the meantime，is there anyone we can contact for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.56,1:28:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.06,1:28:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.39,1:29:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,His name is John McClane。He's a New York City cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.77,1:29:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll find him。Just hang in there，miss，and we'll get to you… very soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.57,1:29:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.62,1:29:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。That's a great girl you got there。Can't wait to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.91,1:29:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter？Cat got your tongue？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.58,1:29:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，John.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.88,1:29:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make a joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.51,1:29:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say somethin'funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.60,1:29:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？Where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.35,1:29:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！McClane！Hold on。Where you goin'？What are you gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.02,1:29:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm gonna do？I'm gonna go kill this guy and get my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.32,1:29:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But she can be anywhere… - Listen。It's gonna get messy。Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.49,1:29:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think I… - Hey，I'm doing you a favour.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.16,1:29:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't bet on me，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.66,1:30:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.75,1:30:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't bet on you either，so I figured I'd lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.72,1:30:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.71,1:30:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI，ma'am。Jersey field office.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.08,1:30:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mind if I see your ID？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.17,1:30:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.30,1:31:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad's a cop。Force of habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.35,1:31:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father sounds like a very smart man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.27,1:31:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid，can you get Bowman？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.69,1:31:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.41,1:31:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's completely dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.50,1:31:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gabriel must have shut down all the satellite links。Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.38,1:31:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Lucy，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.43,1:31:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,About all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.76,1:31:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was my fault you got into this。This wasn't your fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.68,1:31:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got nothin' to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.48,1:31:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let go of me，you bastard！- This bitch is a handful.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.49,1:32:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you gonna be all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.45,1:32:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Behave or I will hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.58,1:32:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？Let's step outside，just you and me。We'll see who hurts who.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.55,1:32:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really are his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.97,1:32:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tie her wrists.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.81,1:32:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trey，Gabriel wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.23,1:32:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is it that time already？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.06,1:32:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.40,1:32:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.99,1:32:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，please！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.95,1:33:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're showing a breach on an exterior vent.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.21,1:33:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.17,1:33:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be long。We're packing up soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.06,1:33:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，McClane，do we have anything resembling a plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.86,1:33:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find Lucy and kill everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.98,1:34:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I mean more like a plan。Like，a way to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.07,1:34:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.12,1:34:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，according to the layout，the chilling towers are kept on the bottom level.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.84,1:34:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think mine's locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.59,1:34:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。Now it looks like we're gettin' somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.02,1:34:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.36,1:34:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，this looks like it controls the cooling system for the mainframe，which should be…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.70,1:34:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I can just hack in…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.41,1:34:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and trip the alarm，it might alert Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.71,1:35:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone set off the alarms.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.59,1:35:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Thank you，detective。I can hear that。Find a way to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.89,1:35:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have you got？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.97,1:35:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a problem。The alarms went off at Woodlawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.77,1:35:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gotta be him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.77,1:35:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what's Woodlawn？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.11,1:35:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's NSA…a secure facility outside of Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.28,1:35:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a fail-safe we built after 9/11 to back up all financial information.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.12,1:35:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The moment networks were hit，all financial data began downloading to those servers.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.21,1:35:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Banks，Wall Street，corporate records，government funds，all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.38,1:35:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Basically，a backup for the accumulated wealth of America.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.30,1:35:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,All in one location？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.85,1:35:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What could Gabriel do with it？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.60,1:36:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he could get in，he might try to transfer the data to a portable hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.64,1:36:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then he'd have access to those accounts from anywhere。Siphon off billions for himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.61,1:36:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,We couldn't trace it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.28,1:36:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or，knowing him，he could erase it all and send us all back to the Stone Age.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.28,1:36:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why the hell wasn't I told about this？- Frankly，it's above your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.75,1:36:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,My pay grade？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.17,1:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How the hell did Gabriel find out about this when even I didn't know about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.80,1:36:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He designed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.47,1:36:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was his program.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.35,1:36:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knew that hacking your system last night would trigger the download.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.73,1:36:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.40,1:36:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You two geniuses，stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.61,1:36:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can get a floor plan of this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.91,1:36:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.95,1:37:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，get away from the bag。Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.58,1:37:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.29,1:37:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.29,1:37:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？I've been waiting for you，too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.99,1:37:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.16,1:37:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.29,1:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.08,1:37:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matt？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.29,1:37:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.81,1:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Emerson.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.94,1:38:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a problem in one of the cooling towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.44,1:38:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Tower seven。- Tower seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.90,1:38:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.32,1:38:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arrivo subito。OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.45,1:38:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.58,1:38:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the HR team to stand by。We need to get to Woodlawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.37,1:38:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The roads out are blocked。DC's in total gridlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.25,1:38:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then get us some helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.17,1:38:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were all pulled by the Pentagon for search and rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.21,1:38:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Molina，find me some goddamn helicopters immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.72,1:38:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，the Pentagon has jets flying CAP over DC.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.89,1:38:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have them send one to Woodlawn and keep an eye on things.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.93,1:38:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.15,1:38:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.32,1:39:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Russo，check in.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.70,1:39:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I think Russo's on his way down to meet your girlfriend，dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.92,1:39:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute。Looks like he's coming around.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.63,1:39:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's McClane！He's on the third floor！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.13,1:39:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get all that？That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.47,1:39:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on the third floor。But I'm coming to get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.61,1:39:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move now。I'll send a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.28,1:39:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill this guy and I'll give you Mai's cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.53,1:39:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Je vous rejoins.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.20,1:40:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,My algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.13,1:40:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，please，God.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.13,1:40:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please，God…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.29,1:41:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jesus，they're going after the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.32,1:41:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You coming to get me，John？Is that the plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.32,1:41:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yep，that's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.62,1:41:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think I won't put a bullet in your daughter's head？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.08,1:41:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cos you're scared of me。- You think I'm afraid of you？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.08,1:42:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otherwise she'd be dead already。You need a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.34,1:42:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop there！Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.18,1:42:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you kill me，you'll never get it open.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.72,1:42:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eccoti qui，piccolo stronzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.56,1:42:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move away。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.03,1:42:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，John，I feel like we've gotten off on the wrong foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.20,1:42:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And because of that，you think I'm the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.87,1:42:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing could be further from the truth。I'm the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.75,1:42:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told them this could happen if they didn't prepare.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.33,1:42:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I get a thank-you？No，I got crucified。But they wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.00,1:42:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You got their attention now，don't you？- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.92,1:42:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am doing the country a favour。- By tearing it apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.68,1:42:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better me than some outsider。Some religious nut-job bent on Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.89,1:43:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to see that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.64,1:43:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything I've broken can be fixed if the country is willing to pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.98,1:43:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，bullshit。It's always been about the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.36,1:43:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I shouldn't get paid for my work？I'm working my ass off here，John.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.66,1:43:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，just sit tight，asshole。I got a cheque for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.42,1:43:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't talk to this guy。You talk to him，see if you can get him to focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.29,1:43:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.34,1:43:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.47,1:43:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now there are only five of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.31,1:43:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on，Lucy。I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.11,1:43:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would somebody please kill this son of a bitch？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.24,1:43:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.95,1:44:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's actually no problem。I just got off on the wrong floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.58,1:44:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.59,1:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。I'm truly impressed，man。Hacking every byte of financial data
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.88,1:44:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the entire country'd take weeks unless you eliminated the congestion.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.22,1:44:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what this fire sale is about，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.47,1:44:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's brilliant。- Yes，it is。Please be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.77,1:44:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Asshole。- Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.90,1:44:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matt Farrell.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.27,1:44:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucy McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.69,1:44:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought your name was Gennero。Lucy Gennero.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.24,1:44:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.12,1:44:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you crack the code？- Maybe。I mean，if I had enough time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.16,1:44:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.08,1:44:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take them with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.46,1:44:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go。- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gabriel，Pentagon just sent an F-35 towards us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.01,1:44:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.97,1:45:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pulling down the 「go」 codes now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.53,1:45:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might wanna think about what you want on your headstone，asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.83,1:45:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ。Goddamn hamster！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.21,1:45:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.71,1:45:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay still，spider-boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.18,1:45:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.04,1:46:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddammit！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.05,1:46:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.68,1:46:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You probably shouldn't antagonise them，since they have all the loaded guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.23,1:46:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a minute and dig deep for a bigger set of balls，cos you're gonna need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.73,1:46:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow。I know that tone。It's just weird hearing it from someone… with hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.36,1:47:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.61,1:47:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,ETA 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.17,1:47:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.83,1:48:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.66,1:48:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？You're just gonna kill me if I fix it。I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.72,1:48:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.01,1:48:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.19,1:48:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，no，no，no！Shit！- Robinson is coming pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.02,1:48:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry，what？- Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.27,1:48:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Robinson is coming too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.70,1:48:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.74,1:48:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.09,1:49:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.13,1:49:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.80,1:49:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.68,1:49:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I know you can hear me。This is your frequency，right？666.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.31,1:49:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，pick up the mic，Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.73,1:49:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody here by that name。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.15,1:49:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hackerjerk-off！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.28,1:49:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warlock…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.41,1:49:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you to do whatever it is you do to patch me through to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.75,1:49:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,To Deputy Director Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.83,1:49:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You hear me？- Are you serious？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.50,1:49:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to intentionally open up a com line
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.13,1:49:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the head of the FBI's cyber division？I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.26,1:49:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freddy，goddammit，they have my daughter！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.01,1:49:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can do that。Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.60,1:50:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.86,1:50:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Central。We have a patch for Director Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.70,1:50:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir。Central's trying to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.03,1:50:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.12,1:50:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bowman，it's McClane。- McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.66,1:50:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。Gabriel is on the 695 headed north in a Hazmat truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.63,1:50:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，Gabriel's left Woodlawn？We're headed there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.67,1:50:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bowman。He's got my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.51,1:50:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，this Hazmat truck is a government vehicle，so it should be LoJacked，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.26,1:50:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Track that down，it should take you to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.56,1:50:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me the tag number。- All right。Hang on。Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.19,1:50:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Golf… Tango…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.86,1:50:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,five… niner… two… November.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.07,1:50:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it。McClane，where is Farrell？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.78,1:50:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.20,1:50:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.78,1:51:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go in there and get Lucy out，but if something happens to me，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.33,1:51:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,you gotta send the cavalry in，you hear me？I mean everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.96,1:51:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let that maniac get my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.21,1:51:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- John，don't worry。- I want your word，Bowman.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.97,1:51:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.43,1:51:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane out.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.52,1:51:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's the F-35.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.32,1:51:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get the 「go」 codes？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.69,1:51:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Trey。Did you get the 「go」 codes？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.20,1:51:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you connect me to the pilot？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.95,1:51:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.46,1:51:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isolating his radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.85,1:52:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sending him the 「go」 codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.73,1:52:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,AV-81.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.07,1:52:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- AV-81，this is Marine Air Wing ATC。- Go for AV-81.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.49,1:52:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Confirmed terrorist vehicle located in your sector。A big rig truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.62,1:52:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Currently in pursuit of a Hazmat vehicle。- I see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.62,1:52:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are authorised to engage and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.46,1:52:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy that。AV-81 engaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.13,1:52:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.23,1:52:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ！Goddammit！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.52,1:52:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're shooting at the wrong guy！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.41,1:53:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think Daddy's coming，honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.21,1:53:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Jackass！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.31,1:54:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that it？Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.60,1:54:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that your best shot？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.31,1:54:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.41,1:55:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.09,1:55:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.35,1:57:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.40,1:57:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way。It's that way。Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.49,1:57:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are leaving in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.41,1:57:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have one.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.83,1:57:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rules haven't changed。You'll kill me the minute I unlock it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.17,1:57:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，shit！Oh，shit！- Matthew？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.84,1:57:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matthew！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.18,1:57:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really need you to pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.10,1:57:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The rules can always change。- OK，wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.93,1:57:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna shoot her in ten seconds。- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.39,1:57:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.35,1:57:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.02,1:57:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.11,1:57:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.69,1:57:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.03,1:57:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.16,1:58:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，OK，OK！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.70,1:58:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.37,1:58:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，stop！Stop，stop！I'm doing it。I'm doing it！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.38,1:58:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God。Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.52,1:58:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Feds are headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.98,1:58:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get everything on the plane。- Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.74,1:58:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad！- Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.78,1:58:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，baby。Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.29,1:58:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.09,1:58:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.21,1:58:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.57,1:59:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.70,1:59:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.95,1:59:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got her？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.54,1:59:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.54,1:59:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice effort，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.79,1:59:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Matthew！- Oh，shit！All right，OK！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.96,1:59:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK！I'm doin' it。I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.68,1:59:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.77,1:59:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you do me a favour？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.02,1:59:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know the lights are beginning to dim，but if you could just hang on for a second，
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.07,1:59:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,when Matt's finished，I'm gonna kill him and your daughter，
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.36,2:00:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I would love for you to see that.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.83,2:00:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddammit。Matthew？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.37,2:00:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten seconds，OK？You'll have all your money.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.96,2:00:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You just leave。No one has to get hurt，OK？- A few seconds。Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.13,2:00:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.29,2:00:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.88,2:00:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.51,2:00:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,On your tombstone it should read，「Always in the wrong place at the wrong time.」
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.56,2:00:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about，「Yippee-ki-yay，motherf…」
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.24,2:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daddy… Daddy… Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.03,2:00:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you OK？- Yes，baby，I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.25,2:00:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.87,2:00:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I'd come for you，honey。Sorry it took me so long。It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.47,2:01:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move，move.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.18,2:01:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.89,2:01:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold，hold！He's OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.77,2:01:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get that vehicle。- Come around！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.53,2:01:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here，help Daddy up。- OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.74,2:01:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oooh！Wait，wait。I think I'll just stay here for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.53,2:01:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- OK。Daddy，you're outta your mind。- What are you talkin' about？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.75,2:01:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You shot yourself！- It seemed like a good idea at the time.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.67,2:01:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell these guys that I did that.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.14,2:01:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for all your help，John。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.90,2:01:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he OK？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.90,2:02:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Should I put my hands up？- No，don't put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.82,2:02:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put 'em down further？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.24,2:02:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Might die of shock on the way to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.29,2:02:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.16,2:02:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.79,2:02:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Oh，hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.05,2:02:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's it feel to be shot？- It actually feels great.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.76,2:02:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He gave me some… What's it called？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.19,2:02:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mor？- Morphine.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.26,2:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，you got your merit badge now。- Yeah。I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.02,2:02:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Plus，you know，chicks dig scars。- Really？Hm.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.52,2:02:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not that one.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.61,2:02:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.48,2:02:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you know what I was thinking？Did she say something to you？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.32,2:02:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I felt like we had kind of a vibe。- Easy。That's just the morphine kickin' in.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.95,2:02:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.45,2:02:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，after all we've been through，I'd hate to have to beat you to death.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.29,2:03:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would suck.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.88,2:03:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good to go？- Yeah，all set.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.80,2:03:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself。I'll see you at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.39,2:03:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.14,2:03:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for saving my daughter's life。- Hey…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.65,2:03:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was I gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.48,2:03:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what makes you that guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.65,2:03:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.41,2:03:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，um，did he say anything about me？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.21,2:03:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.34,2:03:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？I'm sorry。I'm just asking.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.05,2:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in enough pain already.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.55,2:03:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hospital.
